ularity and reputation are just evident. </div>\r\n                                                <div class=\"author-info\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"testimonial-slider__media\">\r\n                                                        <img src=\"assets/images/testimonial/mitech-testimonial-avata-03-70x70.webp\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <div class=\"testimonial-slider__author\">\r\n                                                        <h6 class=\"name\">Monica Blews</h6>\r\n                                                        <span class=\"designation\">PR Officer</span>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"swiper-slide swiper-slide-active\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"0\" style=\"width: 336px; margin-right: 50px;\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"testimonial-slider__single wow move-up\" style=\"visibility: hidden; animation-name: none;\">\r\n                                                <h6 class=\"testimonial-subject\">The Mitech team works really hard to ensure high level of quality</h6>\r\n                                                <div class=\"testimonial-slider__text\">There are thousands of IT service companies in the US. But there’s nothing like @Mitech. Their popularity and reputation are just evident. </div>\r\n                                                <div class=\"author-info\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"testimonial-slider__media\">\r\n                                                        <img src=\"assets/images/testimonial/mitech-testimonial-avata-04-70x70.webp\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <div class=\"testimonial-slider__author\">\r\n                                                        <h6 class=\"name\">Maggie Strickland</h6>\r\n                                                        <span class=\"designation\">WEB DESIGNER</span>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"swiper-slide swiper-slide-next\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"1\" style=\"width: 336px; margin-right: 50px;\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"testimonial-slider__single wow move-up\" style=\"visibility: hidden; animation-name: none;\">\r\n                                                <h6 class=\"testimonial-subject\">The Mitech team works really hard to ensure high level of quality</h6>\r\n                                                <div class=\"testimonial-slider__text\">I discovered @Mitech services by chance on the Internet to find a suitable IT services provider. This must be fate, not an accident at all.</div>\r\n                                                <div class=\"author-info\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"testimonial-slider__media\">\r\n                                                        <img src=\"assets/images/testimonial/mitech-testimonial-avata-02-70x70.webp\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <div class=\"testimonial-slider__author\">\r\n                                                        <h6 class=\"name\">Robert Amplilian</h6>\r\n                                                        <span class=\"designation\">Marketing</span>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"swiper-slide\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"2\" style=\"width: 336px; margin-right: 50px;\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"testimonial-slider__single wow move-up\" style=\"visibility: hidden; animation-name: none;\">\r\n                                                <h6 class=\"testimonial-subject\">The Mitech team works really hard to ensure high level of quality</h6>\r\n                                                <div class=\"testimonial-slider__text\">IT service is not an easy path to follow. But these guys can make it to the top with premium services and dedicated customer support.</div>\r\n                                                <div class=\"author-info\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"testimonial-slider__media\">\r\n                                                        <img src=\"assets/images/testimonial/mitech-testimonial-avata-01-70x70.webp\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <div class=\"testimonial-slider__author\">\r\n                                                        <h6 class=\"name\">Stephen Mearsley</h6>\r\n                                                        <span class=\"designation\">PR Officer</span>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"swiper-slide swiper-slide-duplicate-prev\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"3\" style=\"width: 336px; margin-right: 50px;\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"testimonial-slider__single wow move-up\" style=\"visibility: hidden; animation-name: none;\">\r\n                                                <h6 class=\"testimonial-subject\">The Mitech team works really hard to ensure high level of quality</h6>\r\n                                                <div class=\"testimonial-slider__text\">There are thousands of IT service companies in the US. But there’s nothing like @Mitech. Their popularity and reputation are just evident. </div>\r\n                                                <div class=\"author-info\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"testimonial-slider__media\">\r\n                                                        <img src=\"assets/images/testimonial/mitech-testimonial-avata-03-70x70.webp\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <div class=\"testimonial-slider__author\">\r\n                                                        <h6 class=\"name\">Monica Blews</h6>\r\n                                                        <span class=\"designation\">PR Officer</span>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"swiper-slide swiper-slide-duplicate swiper-slide-duplicate-active\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"0\" style=\"width: 336px; margin-right: 50px;\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"testimonial-slider__single wow move-up\" style=\"visibility: hidden; animation-name: none;\">\r\n                                                <h6 class=\"testimonial-subject\">The Mitech team works really hard to ensure high level of quality</h6>\r\n                                                <div class=\"testimonial-slider__text\">There are thousands of IT service companies in the US. But there’s nothing like @Mitech. Their popularity and reputation are just evident. </div>\r\n                                                <div class=\"author-info\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"testimonial-slider__media\">\r\n                                                        <img src=\"assets/images/testimonial/mitech-testimonial-avata-04-70x70.webp\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <div class=\"testimonial-slider__author\">\r\n                                                        <h6 class=\"name\">Maggie Strickland</h6>\r\n                                                        <span class=\"designation\">WEB DESIGNER</span>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                        </div></div>\r\n                                <span class=\"swiper-notification\" aria-live=\"assertive\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></span></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"swiper-pagination swiper-pagination-t0 section-space--mt_30 swiper-pagination-clickable swiper-pagination-bullets\"><span class=\"swiper-pagination-bullet swiper-pagination-bullet-active\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 1\"></span><span class=\"swiper-pagination-bullet\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 2\"></span><span class=\"swiper-pagination-bullet\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 3\"></span><span class=\"swiper-pagination-bullet\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 4\"></span></div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================-->\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n            <!--========== Call to Action Area Start ============-->\r\n            <div class=\"cta-image-area_one section-space--ptb_80 cta-bg-image_one\">\r\n                <div class=\"container\">\r\n                    <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\r\n                        <div class=\"col-xl-8 col-lg-7\">\r\n                            <div class=\"cta-content md-text-center\">\r\n                                <h3 class=\"heading text-white\">Assess your business potentials and find opportunities <span class=\"text-color-secondary\">for bigger success</span></h3>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-5\">\r\n                            <div class=\"cta-button-group--one text-center\">\r\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn--white btn-one\"><span class=\"btn-icon me-2\"><i class=\"far fa-comment-alt\"></i></span> Let\'s talk</a>\r\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn--secondary  btn-two\"><span class=\"btn-icon me-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-info-circle\"></i></span> Get info</a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <!--========== Call to Action Area End ============-->\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n        </div>', '1', 999, 7, '2023-10-16 21:34:21', '2024-02-27 06:50:20'),
(69, 2, 'timeline', 'Timeline', '<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" \r\n height=\"50px\">\r\n  <!-- Embedding an image -->\r\n  <image xlink:href=\"https://test.webfire.in/public/admin/theme/img/user.jpg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" />\r\n</svg>', '{class : \'\',id:\'\'}', '<div class=\"site-wrapper-reveal\">\r\n            <div class=\"timeline-area section-space--ptb_120\">\r\n                <div class=\"container\">\r\n                    <div class=\"row\">\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-12\">\r\n                            <div class=\"ht-timeline style-01\">\r\n                                <ul class=\"tm-timeline-list ht-animation-queue\">\r\n                                    <li class=\"line\"></li>\r\n                                    <li class=\"item animate\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"dots\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"middle-dot\"></div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n\r\n                                        <div class=\"row\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"col-md-6 timeline-col left timeline-feature\">\r\n                                                <div class=\"inner\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"date-wrap\">\r\n                                                        <h2 class=\"year\">1988</h2>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                                    <div class=\"photo\">\r\n                                                        <img src=\"assets/images/timeline/timeline-image-01.webp\" alt=\"timeline-image-01\" class=\"img-fluid\">\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                            <div class=\"col-md-6 timeline-col right timeline-info\">\r\n                                                <div class=\"inner\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"content-wrap\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n                                                            <h6 class=\"heading\">The Foundation of Mitech</h6>\r\n\r\n                                                            <div class=\"text\">\r\n                                                                The beginning of Mitech Co. was laid by three men: Jackie Moodle, Alan Morray and Burrow Kills. Back in 1988, three passionate young pupils, whose major is Information Technology, had discussed with each other about starting a company to deliver technological &amp; digital services in an old rented apartment. </div>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </li>\r\n                                    <li class=\"item animate\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"dots\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"middle-dot\"></div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n\r\n                                        <div class=\"row\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"col-md-6 timeline-col left timeline-feature\">\r\n                                                <div class=\"inner\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"date-wrap\">\r\n                                                        <h6 class=\"year\"> 1993 </h6>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                                    <div class=\"photo\">\r\n                                                        <img src=\"assets/images/timeline/timeline-image-02.webp\" alt=\"timeline-image-01\" class=\"img-fluid\">\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                            <div class=\"col-md-6 timeline-col right timeline-info\">\r\n                                                <div class=\"inner\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"content-wrap\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n                                                            <h6 class=\"heading\">Mitech’s Golden Age</h6>\r\n\r\n                                                            <div class=\"text\">\r\n                                                                Mitech had been operating for 5 years when it reached the golden age in the company’s history. They received two prestigious awards for Dedicated Services &amp; Community Contribution (in 1990), plus three successive award nominations for Best IT Company of the year (respectively in 1991, 1992 &amp; 1993).\r\n                                                            </div>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </li>\r\n                                    <li class=\"item animate\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"dots\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"middle-dot\"></div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n\r\n                                        <div class=\"row\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"col-md-6 timeline-col left timeline-feature\">\r\n                                                <div class=\"inner\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"date-wrap\">\r\n                                                        <h6 class=\"year\"> 1995 </h6>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                                    <div class=\"photo\">\r\n                                                        <img src=\"assets/images/timeline/blog-07-500x350.webp\" alt=\"timeline-image-01\" class=\"img-fluid\">\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                            <div class=\"col-md-6 timeline-col right timeline-info\">\r\n                                                <div class=\"inner\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"content-wrap\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n                                                            <h6 class=\"heading\">Mitech’s Turning Point</h6>\r\n\r\n                                                            <div class=\"text\">\r\n                                                                The company has a turning point in 1995 when one of its founders left the board of the management and established a new company in Healthcare &amp; Assurance – HealSoul. Later on, Mitech and HealSoul have successfully cooperated in several projects to integrate technology into taking care of people’s health. .\r\n                                                            </div>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </li>\r\n                                </ul>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n            <!--========== Call to Action Area Start ============-->\r\n            <div class=\"cta-image-area_one section-space--ptb_80 cta-bg-image_one\">\r\n                <div class=\"container\">\r\n                    <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\r\n                        <div class=\"col-xl-8 col-lg-7\">\r\n                            <div class=\"cta-content md-text-center\">\r\n                                <h3 class=\"heading text-white\">Assess your business potentials and find opportunities <span class=\"text-color-secondary\">for bigger success</span></h3>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-5\">\r\n                            <div class=\"cta-button-group--one text-center\">\r\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn--white btn-one\"><span class=\"btn-icon me-2\"><i class=\"far fa-comment-alt\"></i></span> Let\'s talk</a>\r\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn--secondary  btn-two\"><span class=\"btn-icon me-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-info-circle\"></i></span> Get info</a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <!--========== Call to Action Area End ============-->\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n        </div>', '1', 999, 7, '2023-10-16 21:34:21', '2024-02-27 06:50:20');
INSERT INTO `ab_blocks` (`id`, `category_id`, `blockid`, `label`, `media`, `attributes`, `content`, `status`, `seq`, `theme_id`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(70, 4, 'home1', 'Home 1', '<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" \r\n height=\"50px\">\r\n  <!-- Embedding an image -->\r\n  <image xlink:href=\"https://test.webfire.in/public/admin/theme/img/user.jpg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" />\r\n</svg>', '{class : \'\',id:\'\'}', '<div class=\"site-wrapper-reveal\">\n            <!--============ Infotechno Hero Start ============-->\n            <div class=\"infotechno-hero infotechno-bg\">\n                <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n                    <div class=\"row align-items-center\"><!--baseline-->\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6\">\n                            <div class=\"infotechno-hero-text  wow move-up animated\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n                                <h6>IT Design &amp; Consulting </h6>\n                                <h1 class=\"font-weight--reguler mb-15\">Facilitate All <br>  Local IT-related Service Providers </h1>\n                                <p>Highly Tailored IT Design, Management &amp; Support Services. </p>\n                                <div class=\"hero-button  mt-30\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"ht-btn ht-btn-md\">Get details</a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6\">\n                            <div class=\"infotechno-hero-inner-images\">\n                                <div class=\"infotechno-inner-one\">\n                                    <img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"assets/images/hero/home-infotechno-main-slider-slide-01-image-01.webp\" alt=\"\">\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"infotechno-inner-two  wow move-up animated\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n                                    <img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"assets/images/hero/home-infotechno-main-slider-slide-01-image-02.webp\" alt=\"\">\n        