uot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-divider&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;elementor-divider-separator&quot;&gt;\n                                &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;f5ceb81&quot; data-element_type=&quot;container&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-f5ceb81 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;e-con-inner&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;2d7783bf&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;tp-unfold.default&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-2d7783bf elementor-widget elementor-widget-tp-unfold&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;plus6652150753b9f&quot; data-content_a_source=&quot;content&quot; data-con_pos=&quot;default&quot; data-icon-position=&quot;tp_ic_pos_before&quot; data-readmore=&quot;Read More&quot; data-readless=&quot;Read Less&quot; data-readmore-icon=&quot;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&amp;quot;true&amp;quot; class=&amp;quot;e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-down&amp;quot; viewBox=&amp;quot;0 0 320 512&amp;quot; xmlns=&amp;quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&amp;quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&amp;quot;M143 352.3L7 216.3c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l22.6-22.6c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l96.4 96.4 96.4-96.4c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-136 136c-9.2 9.4-24.4 9.4-33.8 0z&amp;quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&quot; data-readless-icon=&quot;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&amp;quot;true&amp;quot; class=&amp;quot;e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-up&amp;quot; viewBox=&amp;quot;0 0 320 512&amp;quot; xmlns=&amp;quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&amp;quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&amp;quot;M177 159.7l136 136c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-22.6 22.6c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L160 255.9l-96.4 96.4c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L7 329.7c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l136-136c9.4-9.5 24.6-9.5 34-.1z&amp;quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&quot; data-transition-duration=&quot;200&quot; data-content-max-height=&quot;86&quot; data-content-max-height-t=&quot;100&quot; data-content-max-height-m=&quot;80&quot; class=&quot;tp-unfold-wrapper plus6652150753b9f&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;tp-unfold-title&quot;&gt;Two Wheeler/Bike Service at Home&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;tp-unfold-description&quot; id=&quot;i7z43h&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;tp-unfold-description-inner&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now get two-wheeler service at doorstep and book bike repair service\n                                                    through our Apna Mechanic bike service app. Don&#039;t look for\n                                                    Motorcycle Repair Shop, simply get a certified bike mechanic and\n                                                    bike electrician right at your home or office. We cater bike service\n                                                    and repair for almost all two-wheeler &lt;a href=&quot;brands/index.html&quot;&gt;bike brands in India&lt;/a&gt; which include\n                                                    Bajaj, Honda, Yamaha, Royal Enfield, Hero, Hero Honda, Suzuki, TVS,\n                                                    Vespa, Aprilla, KTM, Kawasaki and all other leading two wheeler\n                                                    brands. Best two-wheeler service experience at the comfort of your\n                                                    home when using Apna Mechanic bike service app to book scooty and\n                                                    motorbike repair online. Be it a periodic service, repair or bike\n                                                    cleaning and polishing or accidental repairs, Apna Mechanic is a one\n                                                    stop application for all your bike service and repair needs. No need\n                                                    to search for bike service near me or bike mechanic near me or bike\n                                                    electrician near me, simply choose from our vast bike service plans\n                                                    offerings and avail special discount offers just for you. Bike\n                                                    service at home is easy with Apna Mechanic. All you need to do is\n                                                    download the Apna Mechanic bike service app for quick access to\n                                                    nearby Bike Mechanic. Select your bike and book the bike service\n                                                    online. If you need any assistance with the booking, you can contact\n                                                    our customer service for clarity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Book Bike Mechanic at Home&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bajaj - Avenger Cruise 200 Service | &lt;a href=&quot;bajaj/pulsar/index.html&quot;&gt;Bajaj Pulsar 150 Service&lt;/a&gt; |\n                                                    Bajaj Pulsar 200 ES | Hero Motorcorp - Passion Plus | Hero Motorcorp\n                                                    - &lt;a href=&quot;hero/splendor/index.html&quot;&gt;Splendor Plus&lt;/a&gt; AMC | &lt;a href=&quot;honda/activa/index.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Honda Activa 5G Std Services&lt;/a&gt; | Honda - CB\n                                                    Unicorn Std | Royal Enfield - Classic 350 | Bike Repair at Home | &lt;a href=&quot;royal-enfield/index.html&quot;&gt;Bullet Bike Service&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EV Bike Services at Home&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Finding a skilled ebike service station or bike technician who is\n                                                    familiar with the intricate functioning of e-bike batteries, brakes,\n                                                    and drive systems is important because e-bikes are not\n                                                    inexpensive.&lt;br/&gt;Like all other bikes, E-bikes require routine\n                                                    maintenance to keep them in good working condition and increase\n                                                    their lifespan.&lt;br/&gt;Apna Mechanic provides a method by that people\n                                                    can get their electric bike repaired at their location in their\n                                                    presence. By providing test rides after maintenance, as well as bike\n                                                    maintenance and warranty work by certified and experienced bike\n                                                    electrician with a mobile setting available at the place of your\n                                                    convenience, we make it easier and more convenient for our clients\n                                                    to select and maintain their ebikes.&lt;br/&gt;This direct-to-consumer\n                                                    approach combines the ease of getting your electric bike serviced at\n                                                    your doorstep with the in-person services that you&#039;d find at Apna\n                                                    Mechanic, which helps reduce some of the worries customers may have\n                                                    while taking their ebike for &lt;a href=&quot;ev-services/index.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;electric bike service&lt;/a&gt; to\n                                                    service centers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Book Bike Electrician at Home&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Best Electric Scooters - &lt;a href=&quot;tvs/iqube/index.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;TVS iQube Electric&lt;/a&gt; / Ola S1 /\n                                                    Ather 450X / &lt;a href=&quot;bajaj/chetak/index.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Bajaj Chetak&lt;/a&gt; / Simple One / Hero Electric\n                                                    Optima / Bounce Infinity E1 / Hero Electric Atria / Okinawa\n                                                    PraisePro / Ampere Magnus / Hero Electric Photon / Okinawa Okhi90 /\n                                                    Evolet Pony / Hero Electric NYX / Okinawa iPraise+&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;tp-unfold-last-toggle flex-start&quot;&gt;&lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;tp-unfold-toggle&quot;&gt;Send&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;5eac6930&quot; data-element_type=&quot;container&quot; data-settings=&quot;{&amp;quot;background_background&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;classic&amp;quot;}&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-5eac6930 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;e-con-inner&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;43f2b1ed&quot; data-element_type=&quot;container&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-43f2b1ed e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;e-con-inner&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;7155b25e&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;text-editor.default&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-7155b25e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;if0jid&quot;&gt;© Copyright 2023. All Rights Reserved. Website\n                                            Design By&lt;/span&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.digitrock.com/website-designing-comp