ousing for poor families.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;itg5l&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;bx bx-store-alt&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;idwtlx&quot;&gt;Water wells construction, Mosque , madarsa and school construction,orphan support, livelihood support, Farmer Agricultural support, other kinds of humanity Support&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;ifyih&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 7, '1', '2023-10-31 05:52:28', '2023-10-31 10:35:24'),
