                       &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon End --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-4 col-md-6 wow move-up&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon Start --&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ht-box-images style-07&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;image-box-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;box-image&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;default-image&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://apnknowledge.webfire.in/public/theme/tech/assets/images/icons/mitech-landing-theme-feature-06-68x68.webp&quot; width=&quot;68&quot; height=&quot;68&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;img-fulid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Abundant Shortcodes &lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text&quot;&gt;A wide ranging of shortcodes are added to Mitech for assisting users on page building process.\n                                                    &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon End --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;footer-preview section-space--ptb_120 prv-section-footer-bg&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-12 col-md-12 m-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;footer-preview-content section-space--ptb_70 text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading text-white&quot;&gt;Take Steps to Get Closer &lt;br/&gt; To The Sweet Smell Of Success Now&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h6 class=&quot;heading text-white mt-25&quot;&gt;A High-growth Approach&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;header-button downlode-btn mt-40&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://1.envato.market/c/417168/275988/4415?subId1=hastheme&amp;subId2=mitech-preview&amp;subId3=https%3A%2F%2Fthemeforest.net%2Fcart%2Fconfigure_before_adding%2F24906742%3Flicense%3Dregular%26size%3Dsource&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fthemeforest.net%2Fcart%2Fconfigure_before_adding%2F24906742%3Flicense%3Dregular%26size%3Dsource&quot; class=&quot;btn btn--white&quot;&gt;Purchase Now &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 56, '1', '2024-05-26 05:50:54', '2024-05-26 07:02:07'),
(181, 323, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}#iyzz1{visibility:visible;}#ihmog{color:black;background-repeat:repeat;background-position:left top;background-attachment:scroll;background-size:auto;background-image:linear-gradient(#f3f3f3 0%, #f3f3f3 100%);}#i2d8k{text-align:center;}#ie1ab{text-align:center;}#itn5l{text-align:left;}#i3yyj{visibility:visible;}#irkeq{text-align:left;}#igfrz{color:black;background-repeat:repeat;background-position:left top;background-attachment:scroll;background-size:auto;background-image:none;}#iuesl{text-align:left;}#ikikf{text-align:left;}#ig7cj{text-align:left;}#ig3mg{text-align:left;}#if734{color:black;font-size:20px;}#i27sy{color:black;font-size:20px;}#ibfdm{color:black;font-size:20px;}#ih0ss{color:black;font-size:20px;}#iw6nvi{font-size:20px;color:#230171;}#ie5ry7{color:#2b008f;font-size:20px;}#i4om72{color:black;font-size:20px;}#iy83fh{width:100%;height:400px;}#iz2nf5{text-align:left;}#iox8sf{color:black;font-size:20px;}#iga88r{margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;}', '&lt;div id=&quot;iy0r&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iuw6&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ic1s&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper position-relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container service-slider__container&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i2ls8&quot; class=&quot;about-banner-wrap banner-space about-us-bg&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-8 m-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-content text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 id=&quot;ipc0qi&quot; class=&quot;mb-15 text-white&quot;&gt;URL BASED APP?&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h5 id=&quot;imygfx&quot; class=&quot;font-weight--normal text-white&quot;&gt;\n                      &lt;/h5&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iga88r&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap layout-section-bg section-space--pt_120 section-space--pb_120&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i0cg4g&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;icz9vu&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Url Based App Designing Services!\n                    &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ip0coe&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;We provide graphics designing services that will help your business stand out. We have a team of experienced designers who will work with you to create a unique design that reflects your brand. \n                      &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;We understand that every business is different and that your design needs may vary. That?s why we offer a free consultation to discuss your specific needs.\n                    &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://webfire.in/page/Contact-Us&quot; id=&quot;ildxz&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md&quot;&gt;Find out more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-left mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://webfire.in/public/temp/24/WhatsApp_Image_2024-03-08_at_10_40_27_AM-removebg-preview.png&quot; width=&quot;726&quot; height=&quot;435&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;iy83fh&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--======== Tabs Wrapper Start ======== --&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ihmog&quot; class=&quot;tabs-wrapper section-space--ptb_100&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ij3oa&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-12&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iyzz1&quot; class=&quot;section-title-wrapper text-center section-space--mb_60 wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;i2d8k&quot; class=&quot;section-title&quot;&gt;Why Graphics Design Is Important For Businesses?\n                      &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ie1ab&quot;&gt;Graphics design is an important aspect of any business, as it is often the first thing that a potential customer or client will see. A well-designed logo or website can make a big impression, and can help to build trust and credibility. Good graphics can also help to explain complex information quickly and clearly, making it easier for customers to understand what a business does and how it can help them. In today?s competitive market, it?s important for businesses to stand out from the crowd, and investing in good graphics design can be a great way to do this.\n                      &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\n                &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;igfrz&quot; class=&quot;tabs-wrapper section-space--ptb_100&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ie4j9&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-12&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i3yyj&quot; class=&quot;section-title-wrapper text-center section-space--mb_60 wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;itn5l&quot; class=&quot;section-title&quot;&gt;BENEFITS OF GRAPHIC DESIGN FOR BUSINESS GROWTH!\n                      &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ih0ss&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;iix7y&quot;&gt;Positive First Impression.\n                      &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;irkeq&quot;&gt;A strong and effective graphic design can make a positive first impression on potential customers and help your business to stand out from the competition. By using colours, shapes and images in an eye-catching way, you can communicate your brand message and values in a way that is both visually appealing and memorable. An experienced graphic designer will be able to help you to create a design that reflects your brand identity and makes a positive impact on your target audience.\n                      &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;if734&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;irs2s&quot;&gt;Brand Recognition.\n                      &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ig3mg&quot;&gt;Graphic design plays an important role in brand recognition. By creating a visual identity for a company or product, graphic designers can help create a lasting impression in the minds of consumers. In order to be effective, brand recognition through graphic design must be carefully planned and executed. \n                      &lt;br/&gt;An effective graphic design strategy for brand recognition should take into account the company?s target audience, objectives, and budget. The design should be unique and memorable and should be able to convey the company?s message in a clear and concise manner. Careful planning and execution of a graphic design strategy can help a company to build a strong and recognizable brand. By creating a distinct visual identity, graphic designers can help companies to stand out from the competition and build a loyal customer base.\n                      &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ibfdm&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;if393&quot;&gt;Building Trust and Goodwill.\n                      &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ikikf&quot;&gt;Graphic design can be a powerful tool for building trust and goodwill. By effectively communicating your brand?s values and mission, you can create a strong impression that will resonate with your audience. Your design should be consistent with the overall tone of your organization, and should reflect your commitment to quality and excellence. By investing in good design, you can send a clear message that you are invested in your brand and your customers.\n                      &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i27sy&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i6r2k&quot;&gt;Higher conversions.\n                      &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ig7cj&quot;&gt;Graphic design can be a powerful tool for driving conversions. By creating visuals that are visually appealing and align with your brand, you can create a sense of trust and credibility with your audience. Additionally, effective use of color, typography and other design elements can help to guide users through your conversion funnel, making it more likely that they?ll take the desired action. By investing in quality graphic design, you can increase the likelihood that users will take the desired action on your website or app, ultimately leading to more conversions.\n                      &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i4om72&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;ivdoyn&quot;&gt;Attract and keep customers interested.\n                      &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iuesl&quot;&gt;Graphic design is a critical part of any business?s marketing and advertising efforts. By using strategic design elements, businesses can effectively communicate their brand message and attract new customers. Additionally, graphic design can be used to keep existing customers interested and engaged with a company?s products or services. When done correctly, graphic design can be a powerful tool for driving business growth.\n                      &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iox8sf&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;ik4z05&quot;&gt;Save time &amp;amp; money.\n                      &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iz2nf5&quot;&gt;Graphic design is a process of creating visual content to communicate messages. By applying visual hierarchy and page layout techniques, graphic designers use typography and pictures to meet users? specific needs and focus on the logic of displaying elements in interactive designs to optimize the user experience. \n                      &lt;br/&gt;Through graphic design, you can effectively save time and money while still delivering a high-quality product. When done correctly, graphic design can help to increase brand awareness, improve customer retention, and drive sales. All of these factors can lead to increased profits for your business.\n                      &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ie5ry7&quot;&gt;\n                    &lt;/p&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;iw6nvi&quot;&gt;NOW, IT&#039;S YOUR TURN FOR GETTING BENEFITED THROUGH GRAPHIC DESIGNS.\n                    &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\n                &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======== Tabs Wrapper End ======== --&gt;&lt;!--======== Tabs Wrapper Start ======== --&gt;&lt;!--======== Tabs Wrapper End ======== --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 24, '1', '2024-03-07 04:46:31', '2024-03-08 06:34:17');
