ot;ifc55&quot; class=&quot;elementor elementor-3491&quot;&gt;&lt;section data-id=&quot;40fd8216&quot; data-element_type=&quot;section&quot; id=&quot;i6qz5z&quot; class=&quot;elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-40fd8216 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default ct-header-fixed-none ct-row-max-none&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;2a114ffb&quot; data-element_type=&quot;column&quot; id=&quot;icfd6j&quot; class=&quot;elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2a114ffb&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iojtj6&quot; class=&quot;elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;e7c34af&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;ct_heading.default&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-e7c34af elementor-widget elementor-widget-ct_heading&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ct-heading h-align- sub-style2 ct-heading-left item-st-default&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ct-item--inner&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;item--sub-title style2 show-line&quot;&gt; About us&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 data-wow-delay=&quot;ms&quot; id=&quot;i4wj7j&quot; class=&quot;item--title st-default wow fadeInUp&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iat2s4&quot; class=&quot;sp-main&quot;&gt; Tanvi Helping Group COVID Relief Support &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;10df5e6a&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;text-editor.default&quot; id=&quot;inw73s&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-10df5e6a wow fadeInUp elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ip0eap&quot; class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tanvi Helping Group&lt;/b&gt; strength lies in mobilising hundreds of volunteers for citizen led action during times of need. Since 2020, our volunteers have mobilised relief for thousands of people and supported over 20 partner organisations and educational institutions. During the COVID-19 pandemic &lt;b&gt;Tanvi Helping Group&lt;/b&gt; has supported direct financial transfers and groceries for over 1,000 daily wagers and groceries for 500+ children in shelter homes.?&lt;b&gt;Tanvi Helping Group (NGO for Education)?&lt;/b&gt;The goal of Tanvi Helping Group, an NGO for education in India, is to provide quality education for children of disadvantaged communities and make a difference in the lives of those children. A vital part of their initiative is addressing the challenges that prevent these children from obtaining a quality education in their communities.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;section data-id=&quot;6638bf3&quot; data-element_type=&quot;section&quot; class=&quot;elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-6638bf3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default ct-header-fixed-none ct-row-max-none&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;431858c4&quot; data-element_type=&quot;column&quot; class=&quot;elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-431858c4&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;icxcly&quot; class=&quot;elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated&quot;&gt;&lt;img id=&quot;iu3f9i-4&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://tanvihelpinggroup.in/public/temp/27/00000.jpg&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;160cdc54&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;image.default&quot; id=&quot;i91r81&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-160cdc54 wow fadeInRight elementor-widget elementor-widget-image&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;it9i4c&quot; class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section data-id=&quot;4b3b2339&quot; data-element_type=&quot;section&quot; data-settings=&quot;{&amp;quot;stretch_section&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;section-stretched&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;background_background&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;classic&amp;quot;}&quot; id=&quot;i1nryt&quot; class=&quot;elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4b3b2339 elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default ct-header-fixed-none ct-row-max-none&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-background-overlay&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;ed81794&quot; data-element_type=&quot;column&quot; class=&quot;elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ed81794&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;3c14ed29&quot; data-element_type=&quot;column&quot; class=&quot;elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3c14ed29&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section data-id=&quot;41b62b34&quot; data-element_type=&quot;section&quot; data-settings=&quot;{&amp;quot;stretch_section&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;section-stretched&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;background_background&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;classic&amp;quot;}&quot; id=&quot;i1gba1&quot; class=&quot;elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-41b62b34 elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default ct-header-fixed-none ct-row-max-none&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;5a7cd766&quot; data-element_type=&quot;column&quot; class=&quot;elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-5a7cd766&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;/main&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;imzu3&quot; class=&quot;row content-row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ir92l&quot; class=&quot;content-area content-full-width col-12&quot;&gt;&lt;main class=&quot;site-main&quot;&gt;&lt;article class=&quot;post-3491 page type-page status-publish hentry&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;entry-content clearfix&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-elementor-type=&quot;wp-page&quot; data-elementor-id=&quot;3491&quot; id=&quot;iuwg7&quot; class=&quot;elementor elementor-3491&quot;&gt;&lt;section data-id=&quot;40fd8216&quot; data-element_type=&quot;section&quot; id=&quot;ig7gg&quot; class=&quot;elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-40fd8216 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default ct-header-fixed-none ct-row-max-none&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i3vf5&quot; class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt;Tanvi Helping Group is working towards providing holistic education and creating sustainable livelihoods for 5,000 children in the next ten years. For this we focus equally on shelter homes, communities and schools increasing impact and sustainability.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;This organization has remained true to UNESCO?s motto of being ?committed to a holistic and humanistic vision of quality education worldwide, the realization of everyone?s right to education, and the belief that education plays a fundamental role in human, social, and economic development.? As an NGO in India for education, Tanvi Helping Group has shown relentless dedication to making life better for children of disadvantaged communities by providing them with an education that will enable them to have a better future.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Tanvi Helping Group bridges the gaps in formal education and opportunities by providing under-privileged children language and STEAM education, life-skills support and scholarships for higher education.&lt;br/&gt;through volunteers during weekends at Aganbadi Central and orphanages engaged in providing holistic education and life skills support.&lt;br/&gt;through fellows during the week at low-income private and government schools focused on school transformation and improving learning outcomes.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iqvmf2&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Member List&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;article id=&quot;post-4232-2&quot; class=&quot;post-4232 page type-page status-publish hentry&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;entry-content clearfix&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-elementor-type=&quot;wp-page&quot; data-elementor-id=&quot;4232&quot; class=&quot;elementor elementor-4232&quot;&gt;&lt;section data-id=&quot;d3cf329&quot; data-element_type=&quot;section&quot; id=&quot;infgibi&quot; class=&quot;elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-d3cf329 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default ct-header-fixed-none ct-row-max-none&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;d18ef84&quot; data-element_type=&quot;column&quot; class=&quot;elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-d18ef84&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ikxkqv6&quot; class=&quot;elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;1b27dff&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;ct_heading.default&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-1b27dff elementor-widget elementor-widget-ct_heading&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ct_heading-1b27dff-2&quot; class=&quot;ct-heading h-align- sub-style1 ct-heading-left item-st-default&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;idj9d&quot; class=&quot;ct-item--inner&quot;&gt;&lt;img id=&quot;iu3f9i-3&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://tanvihelpinggroup.in/public/temp/27/1.jpg&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;h3 data-wow-delay=&quot;ms&quot; id=&quot;i6etj6a&quot; class=&quot;item--title st-default case-animate-time&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i2pji7e&quot; class=&quot;sp-main&quot;&gt;Vijay Singh Chauhan -? President, Tanvi Helping Group &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;69590da&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;ct_text_editor.default&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-69590da elementor-widget elementor-widget-ct_text_editor&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ct_text_editor-69590da-2&quot; data-wow-delay=&quot;ms&quot; class=&quot;ct-text-editor&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ieqvubb&quot;&gt;Currently the President of Tanvi Helping Group, Mr. Vijay Singh Chauhan holds Master degrees in Social Work (MSW), LLB, PGD Labour Law and Admin Law, BBA and Holistic Education. He is passionate about socio-emotional development of children and now leads the Tanvi Helping Group Fellowship programme. Vijay Singh Chauhan is a seasoned professional with total of 14 years of experience and 07+ years of expertise in CSR in the areas of Education, Skilling, Environment, Disaster Relief, Health and Wellness.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ct-item--inner&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i46ouvj&quot; class=&quot;ct-text-editor elementor-clearfix&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;517ea81&quot; data-element_type=&quot;column&quot; class=&quot;elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-517ea81&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;irswrck&quot; class=&quot;elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;1b27dff&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;ct_heading.default&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-1b27dff elementor-widget elementor-widget-ct_heading&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ct-heading h-align- sub-style1 ct-heading-left item-st-default&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iaoar&quot; class=&quot;ct-item--inner&quot;&gt;&lt;img draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://tanvihelpinggroup.in/public/temp/27/pooja.jpg&quot; id=&quot;ipti2r&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;h3 data-wow-delay=&quot;ms&quot; id=&quot;ih0ccjd&quot; class=&quot;item--title st-default case-animate-time&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i44atza&quot; class=&quot;sp-main&quot;&gt; Pooja Chauhan ? Secretary, Tanvi Helping Group &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;69590da&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;ct_text_editor.default&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-69590da elementor-widget elementor-widget-ct_text_editor&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;ms&quot; id=&quot;iplnga7&quot; class=&quot;ct-text-editor&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;idni41l&quot;&gt;Pooja Chauhan has been volunteering with Tanvi Helping Group since 2020. She believes a good education is a great leveler, and a good ecosystem is a fundamental right to all living on this planet. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ct-item--inner&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i8jqde4&quot; class=&quot;ct-text-editor elementor-clearfix&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;21d305b&quot; data-element_type=&quot;column&quot; class=&quot;elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-21d305b&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iezbmbn&quot; class=&quot;elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;1b27dff&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;ct_heading.default&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-1b27dff elementor-widget elementor-widget-ct_heading&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ct-