(198, 342, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}.row{display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:stretch;flex-wrap:nowrap;padding:10px;}.cell{min-height:75px;flex-grow:1;flex-basis:100%;}#iftg{color:black;font-family:Georgia, serif;font-size:18px;margin:10px 5px 10px 5px;}#ithu{font-size:18px;font-family:Georgia, serif;color:black;margin:0px 5px 0px 5px;}#ihf7{font-size:20px;font-family:Georgia, serif;color:#00611d;margin:0px 5px 0px 5px;text-align:center;}#izvsv{background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:left top;background-attachment:scroll;background-size:cover;background-image:url(&#039;https://dr.itechgurusolution.com/public/temp/28/c1661b91423b64d9d220cd34505afd00.jpg&#039;);height:500px;}@media (max-width: 992px){#ithu{margin:0px 5px 0px 5px;}#iftg{margin:0px 5px 0px 5px;}#izvsv{height:400px;}}@media (max-width: 768px){.row{flex-wrap:wrap;}}@media (max-width: 480px){#iftg{margin:0px 5px 0px 5px;}#ith78{margin:0px 5px 0px 5px;}#ithu{margin:0px 5px 0px 5px;}#izvsv{height:170px;}}', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot; id=&quot;izvsv&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot; id=&quot;in4h8&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ihf7&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;ith78&quot;&gt;About?DR. Daga Consultancy &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-inner&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ct-page-content content-container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iftg&quot;&gt;This highly renowned institute focuses on the all-round holistic development of the children studying in 10 +2  class in various schools in districts of  Rajasthan state  who are about to enter college education. We provides career guidance to the students through psychometric examination by renowned career counselors. Students are motivated to do good courses to earn a good living, arrangements are done so as to enable them to get admission in good colleges and after completing their studies, they get employment in reputed companies. Here we make every effort to ensure excellent job at a good position in companies of national and international repute. Today children do not know about good career options, hence every year they are made aware by giving career prompts in 1000 schools and after that the institute makes the students aware again by calling them with a request  to meet with their parents and take psychometric test. The best career option is selected .Also we take job  guarantee provided that the student acquires knowledge in the true sense and in the best way. The institute also organizes free personality development and French language teaching classes for the students taking admission in the college. We also focus on studies of deprived students at lowest possible fees. Our ultimate objective is to make everyone professional and participate in the development of the state and the country.\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ithu&quot;&gt;This institution is an innovative career-tech company with a decade of experience providing career guidance and upskilling programs for individuals who foster career development. It handholds students from their first psychometric assessments to the point they choose a career for themselves and land a job. It has tie-ups with 200+ universities and  colleges and 200+ corporates. Dr ashutosh daga has a  vision to engrave youths? career journeys, this institution has counselled more than five lakh students. The institution has a high level of reliability and credibility in its field of career counselling. Accredited and recognised by national and international psychological bodies, the institution is truly the best career counselling and job arrangement in rajasthan\n&lt;/p&gt;', 28, '1', '2024-03-28 05:45:24', '2024-04-15 07:30:03'),
(253, 406, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}#i31pm{color:black;margin:0px 10px 0px 10px;font-size:15px;}#iaw8z{text-align:center;font-size:18px;}#in9e5{color:#0b5d00;}.row{display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:stretch;flex-wrap:nowrap;padding:10px;}.cell{min-height:75px;flex-grow:1;flex-basis:100%;}#irrl8{text-align:center;}#i1u73{background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:left top;background-attachment:scroll;background-size:cover;background-image:url(&#039;https://dr.itechgurusolution.com/public/temp/28/1713158718.jpg&#039;);height:400px;}#i53nj{width:20%;height:100%;text-align:center;}#i6q47{text-align:center;}@media (max-width: 992px){#i1u73{height:300px;}}@media (max-width: 768px){.row{flex-wrap:wrap;}}@media (max-width: 480px){#i53nj{width:70%;}#i1u73{height:120px;}}', '&lt;div id=&quot;iggh&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper position-relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container service-slider__container&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i1u73&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;irrl8&quot; class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iwhn1&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i6q47&quot; class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;&lt;img draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://drdagaconsultancy.co.in/public/temp/28/0d9deaeb-f00f-4b47-b38e-3d5e0bddfe39.jpg&quot; id=&quot;i53nj&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iaw8z&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;in9e5&quot;&gt;ABOUT DIRECTOR\n    &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i31pm&quot;&gt;The Founder Director of this social service institute Dr. Ashutosh Daga has a total of 23 years of deep industrial and academic experience. \n    &lt;br/&gt;He worked efficiently as a manager in the field of product management,  market research, goods distribution management and sales in the famous Indian industrial companies like Cipla, Micro Labs, Alembic Ltd.\n    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;He was awarded by Managing Director and Chairman of Ciplab Dr. Y K Hamid during induction closure ceremony in 2001. He trained newly arrived general and special task force executive trainees in the CIPLA company.  He attended many times continuous medical education seminars in various medical domains. He later entered in the field of education in 2007 and worked as Vice Principal, Academic Coordinator in Mewar Girls Institute of Management and Technology, Chittorgarh and accomplished all responsibilities efficiently from time to time. He has organized many national seminars in colleges. \n    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; Many of his highly Acclaimed Research papers have been published in the reputed management journals.\n    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;He is deadly honest, committed, trustworthy, hardworking and a multifaceted personality with many qualities and acumen. \n    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;He have done B SC PCM, M SC MATHS, MIB, MBA, MSW, MJMC, PGD in MKTG &amp;amp; SALES ,M COM, M PHIL Rajasthan University, Ph. D Mohan Lal Sukhadia University, DELF A1, DELF A2, CMS &amp;amp; ED, EMT Indian Rural Medical Association IRMA  degree and diploma . He has proficiency in French language and also goes as a guest teacher to teach students of Hotel Management, Tourism Management of many reputed colleges and universities. He is associated with many colleges and universities as a channel partner.  He completed his school and college studies from Chittorgarh, Ajmer, Udaipur and Jaipur with good marks.\n    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; He also provides free treatment to many patients. He has worked as a Program Officer in National Service Scheme (NSS) and undertaken development of  adopted villages with help of volunteers while working as an associate professor in Shrinathji Group of Institutions,  worked in the Rajsamand center of Indira Gandhi National Open University (IGNOU) and inspired people from different sections of the society to get education through distance education system and also successfully organized term end examinations. Possessing high level of humanity and philanthropy he have been motivating  12th class  studying students from all streams  in around one thousand schools of  Rajsamand, Udaipur, Chittor, Dungarpur, Banswara districts of Rajasthan so as to help them in adopting best course in best colleges. He explains various career opportunities associated with modern vocational degrees and diplomas to  students and helps in getting admission in the best colleges  with job guarantee. He has arranged jobs for the students of  engineering, Pharmacy, Computer Application, Information Technology, Commerce and Business Management  in well-known companies while working as TPO in shrinathji engineering and management college, nathdwara. He has also worked as Assistant Center Superintendent and Central Superintendent for various degree examinations conducted by Mohan Lal Sukhadia University for many years at SIBM centre. He has been giving career guidance and job placement with full dedication and discipline. He has also delivered lectures on various issues related to all-round development of students under Youth Development Cell Scheme in many colleges of Rajasthan Government. He has  also organized a four-day import export workshop of the Indian Foreign Trade Organization (IIFT). He has also organized seminars for students in collaboration with the Federation of Indian Export Organization FIEO. HE has guided many MBA, BBA students in completing their projects. He has been giving soft skill training to many college students, conducting personality development workshops, imparting interview skills. He is a  life time member of Indian Commerce Organization ICA, Indian Society for Training and Development ISTD, Indian Rural Marketing Association RMAI. He has also worked as Research Associate in world reputed  college IBS HYDERABAD. He is  also a member of Rajasthan Media Action Forum. He has been working continuously for the personality development of students, helping them in choosing the right college and right courses. The basic mantra of his life is to continuously serve humanity with unstoppable speed. He has been working to create multiple skilled hugh manpower capable to participate in making india a world super power.\n  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 28, '1', '2024-04-11 11:33:03', '2024-05-01 05:58:49'),
