 Projects wrapper Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  Projects wrapper End =============--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  Blog Section Start ====================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iq60r&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iet85&quot; class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ipd7h&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;About us&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i44aw&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; id=&quot;ijtjll&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iw6d7b&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iz1r4-2&quot; draggable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;DF Maker Develop Video &amp;amp; Photo Designing Software?s which Helps Wedding Photographers to edit their wedding film editing in very easily with less time. DF Maker develop projects for DF Maker Software and?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i6j1sj&quot;&gt;DF Maker&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ifzty4&quot;&gt;?Pro is best perfect finishing tool for wedding video and also for documentary, news, corporate and studio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; id=&quot;ilgsd5&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ic7eo&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i18i6s&quot;&gt;DF Maker Created A Projects Bundle Pack ? DF Maker Gold Projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i1dyro&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; id=&quot;ise69u&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i2skcl&quot;&gt;DF Maker Gold are ready made video projects. It?s a home production of DF Maker.?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i3glzw&quot;&gt;DF Maker?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iodxb2&quot;&gt;Gold with Choose?A Effect ? Transitions &amp;amp; Filters. We are serving in DF Maker Gold Projects series with ready made all functions projects. You will find a variety of readymade projects ? Wedding Reels, Teaser, Wedding Highlights, Portrait Songs, Cinematic Title, Birthday Highlights, Pre-weddings, Pre-wedding teaser, Save the date, Studio Logos, Online Vidhi projects and lots of editing utilities with unlimited video backgrounds, effects, music and Luts.?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iej4i9&quot;&gt;DF Maker?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;itlpou&quot;&gt;Gold is compatible with all versions of?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i7qoci&quot;&gt;DF Maker?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;if6mzj&quot;&gt;Software.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;immv33&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; id=&quot;ih9sfs&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iotw3&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iea29g&quot;&gt;Video &amp;amp; Photo Designing Software?s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i9hff&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iik4hh&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; id=&quot;iccqqz&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;itan87&quot;&gt;We have all elements, effects &amp;amp; graphics for make your cinematic wedding more attractive. This is all ready to use?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i02x0g&quot;&gt;DF Maker?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iaj82&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;igdcg2&quot;&gt;Wedding Projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iswwli&quot;&gt;. In just few mins you can ready your own wedding highlights &amp;amp; teaser.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 36, '1', '2024-04-16 07:15:30', '2024-04-16 07:18:55');
