quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul id=&quot;ic5so&quot;&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;idgy2&quot;&gt;We provide services to developers, builders, contractors, Investors or Self-developing Societies; who have inventories for sale in bulk to offer in the market.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;i05m8&quot;&gt;Service includes like Pre-Sales, Sales, Post-Sales, Marketing Advice &amp;amp; Assistance, Marketing Survey Assistance, Sales Strategies, Correct Data Buying &amp;amp; Analysis, etc.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; id=&quot;i42zt&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInRight animated&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;ijihc&quot; class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot;&gt;SSP ? Retail&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ig01j&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul id=&quot;iyjw6&quot;&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;iy83i&quot;&gt;We provide personalized assistance to the clients who is looking for property. Guide them for property details and make arrangements of the property visit.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;ide84&quot;&gt;Help client to negotiate for the property and purchase or sale at the best price.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;itfni&quot;&gt;Highly updated team in terms of market knowledge and trends.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iaecr&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; id=&quot;i4sm1&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInLeft animated&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;iz0jv&quot; class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot;&gt;SSP ? Exclusive Mandates&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i7vjh&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul id=&quot;ie7pu&quot;&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;ig25s&quot;&gt;We provide services to developers, builders, contractors, Investors or Self-developing Societies; who have inventories for sale in bulk to offer in the market.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;ibcdr&quot;&gt;Service includes like Pre-Sales, Sales, Post-Sales, Marketing Advice &amp;amp; Assistance, Marketing Survey Assistance, Sales Strategies, Correct Data Buying &amp;amp; Analysis, etc.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; id=&quot;ihist&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInRight animated&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;i2v0r&quot; class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot;&gt;SSP ? Retail&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;irwou&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul id=&quot;ibgyk&quot;&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;i13rd&quot;&gt;We provide personalized assistance to the clients who is looking for property. Guide them for property details and make arrangements of the property visit.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;i6x8s&quot;&gt;Help client to negotiate for the property and purchase or sale at the best price.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;iet4i&quot;&gt;Highly updated team in terms of market knowledge and trends.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section id=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;elementor-icon-box-title&quot; id=&quot;i19eb&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;bf2faa3&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-settings=&quot;{&amp;quot;_animation&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;fadeInLeft&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;_animation_delay&amp;quot;:50}&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;heading.default&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-bf2faa3 animated-slow elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading animated fadeInLeft&quot; id=&quot;ibtbl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot; id=&quot;i10iv&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default&quot; id=&quot;ikav4&quot;&gt;Our Philosophy&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot; id=&quot;idmo9&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.3s&quot; class=&quot;col-md-4 wow fadeInUp templatemo-box animated&quot; id=&quot;id2cx&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fa fa-laptop&quot; id=&quot;ieo9b&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot; id=&quot;iyhku&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;elementor-icon-box-title&quot; id=&quot;ial2n&quot;&gt;MISSION&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;il6gh&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;in5di&quot;&gt;Our Mission is to provide ?Reliable Real Estate Services? to all of our clients and customers by conducting all of our business with the highest levels of professionalism, honesty and integrity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.3s&quot; class=&quot;col-md-4 wow fadeInUp templatemo-box animated&quot; id=&quot;iio05&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fa fa-twitter&quot; id=&quot;icw6c&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot; id=&quot;ilnlu&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;elementor-icon-box-title&quot; id=&quot;i521c&quot;&gt;VISION&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iu6d9&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;isi4o&quot;&gt;To be the best and reliable real estate service company in India and across the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.3s&quot; class=&quot;col-md-4 wow fadeInUp templatemo-box animated&quot; id=&quot;in9yw&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fa fa-font&quot; id=&quot;imayi&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot; id=&quot;iktel&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;elementor-icon-box-title&quot; id=&quot;i5ujf&quot;&gt;VALUES&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;isc6k&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iy6np&quot;&gt;&quot;We strive to set the highest standard of quality in everything we do. We always want to drive towards ?the NEXT? great thing! By constantly challenging ourselves to improve and break new ground.&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;', 33, '1', '2024-02-07 11:18:42', '2024-02-08 10:57:17'),
