t;ip0eap&quot; class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tanvi Helping Group&lt;/b&gt; strength lies in mobilising hundreds of volunteers for citizen led action during times of need. Since 2020, our volunteers have mobilised relief for thousands of people and supported over 20 partner organisations and educational institutions. During the COVID-19 pandemic &lt;b&gt;Tanvi Helping Group&lt;/b&gt; has supported direct financial transfers and groceries for over 1,000 daily wagers and groceries for 500+ children in shelter homes.?&lt;b&gt;Tanvi Helping Group (NGO for Education)?&lt;/b&gt;The goal of Tanvi Helping Group, an NGO for education in India, is to provide quality education for children of disadvantaged communities and make a difference in the lives of those children. A vital part of their initiative is addressing the challenges that prevent these children from obtaining a quality education in their communities.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;section data-id=&quot;6638bf3&quot; data-element_type=&quot;section&quot; class=&quot;elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-6638bf3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default ct-header-fixed-none ct-row-max-none&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;431858c4&quot; data-element_type=&quot;column&quot; class=&quot;elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-431858c4&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;icxcly&quot; class=&quot;elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;160cdc54&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;image.default&quot; id=&quot;i91r81&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-160cdc54 wow fadeInRight elementor-widget elementor-widget-image&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;it9i4c&quot; class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section data-id=&quot;4b3b2339&quot; data-element_type=&quot;section&quot; data-settings=&quot;{&amp;quot;stretch_section&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;section-stretched&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;background_background&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;classic&amp;quot;}&quot; id=&quot;i1nryt&quot; class=&quot;elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4b3b2339 elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default ct-header-fixed-none ct-row-max-none&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-background-overlay&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;ed81794&quot; data-element_type=&quot;column&quot; class=&quot;elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ed81794&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;3c14ed29&quot; data-element_type=&quot;column&quot; class=&quot;elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3c14ed29&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section data-id=&quot;41b62b34&quot; data-element_type=&quot;section&quot; data-settings=&quot;{&amp;quot;stretch_section&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;section-stretched&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;background_background&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;classic&amp;quot;}&quot; id=&quot;i1gba1&quot; class=&quot;elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-41b62b34 elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default ct-header-fixed-none ct-row-max-none&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;5a7cd766&quot; data-element_type=&quot;column&quot; class=&quot;elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-5a7cd766&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;/main&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 30, '1', '2024-03-28 05:45:24', '2024-04-07 13:32:57'),
(259, 423, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}#isol{font-size:20px;color:#e10000;font-family:Georgia, serif;margin:0px 10px 0px 10px;}#iobi{color:white;font-family:Georgia, serif;margin:0px 10px 0px 10px;padding:0 0 30px 0;}#iu3f9i{width:100%;}#ifpg8{background-repeat:repeat;background-position:left top;background-attachment:scroll;background-size:auto;background-image:linear-gradient(#000000 0%, #000000 100%);}', '&lt;body id=&quot;iytr&quot;&gt;&lt;img id=&quot;iu3f9i&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://enwpgo.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/aboutus-aboutme.jpg&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot; id=&quot;ifpg8&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;isol&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;About My CSC Shop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iobi&quot;&gt;At My CSC Shop, we are committed to providing exceptional products and services tailored to meet your needs. With a passion for customer satisfaction, we strive to offer a seamless shopping experience coupled with outstanding support.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Our Mission&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Our mission at My CSC Shop is to be your go-to destination for all your computing, software, and consulting needs. We aim to deliver quality products, expert advice, and reliable services that empower our customers to thrive in the digital age.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;What We Offer&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Computing Solutions:&lt;/b&gt; Explore our range of cutting-edge computers, laptops, and accessories designed to enhance your productivity and enjoyment.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Software Expertise: &lt;/b&gt;Discover a curated selection of software solutions that cater to businesses, students, and individuals alike.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Consulting Services: &lt;/b&gt;Leverage our consultancy services to navigate complex IT challenges and unlock new possibilities for your ventures.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Why Choose Us&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Customer-Centric Approach:&lt;/b&gt; Your satisfaction is our priority. We are committed to providing personalized attention and solutions that align with your unique requirements.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Quality Assurance: &lt;/b&gt;We source products from reputable brands and partners to ensure durability, performance, and reliability.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Expert Guidance: Our knowledgeable team is here to assist you at every step, from product selection to after-sales support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 37, '1', '2024-04-17 07:07:47', '2024-06-30 05:05:41'),
(260, 424, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}#iu3f9i{width:100%;}', '&lt;img id=&quot;iu3f9i&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://cgslimited.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/gallery-banner.jpg&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;', 37, '1', '2024-04-17 07:16:41', '2024-04-17 12:53:56');
