right;color:black;}#igcnla{margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0.5rem;color:black;}#i9eawd{margin-bottom:1rem;color:black;}#ia602v{font-weight:bolder;color:red;}#i0ct3g{color:var(--bs-link-color);text-decoration-line:underline;}#ixguzp{font-weight:normal;}@media only screen and (max-width: 2399px){.elementor-element.elementor-element-42d2c4b .eael-filterable-gallery-item-wrap{width:25%;}}@media only screen and (max-width: 1024px){.elementor-element.elementor-element-42d2c4b .eael-filterable-gallery-item-wrap{width:50%;}}@media only screen and (max-width: 767px){.elementor-element.elementor-element-42d2c4b .eael-filterable-gallery-item-wrap{width:50%;}}@media (max-width: 480px){#i81s{margin:0px 780px 1rem 0px;padding:0px 52px 0px 0px;}#i6bu{padding:0px 670px 0px 0px;margin:0px 161px 1rem 0px;}#i7a4h{padding:0px 622px 0px 0px;margin:0px 208px 1rem 0px;}#if6gr{padding:0px 672px 0px 0px;margin:0px 158px 1rem 0px;}#imu9l{padding:0px 832px 0px 0px;}#it9lk{padding:0px 833px 0px 0px;}#iug3s{padding:0px 835px 0px 0px;}#ig3it{padding:0px 835px 0px 0px;}#is3uh{padding:0px 835px 0px 0px;}#i92ou{padding:0px 831px 0px 0px;}#i1yv1{padding:0px 841px 0px 0px;text-align:center;}#ivxu2{padding:0px 832px 0px 0px;}#i8ygt{padding:0px 832px 0px 0px;}#ism9g{padding:0px 831px 0px 0px;}#igo5j{padding:0px 837px 0px 0px;}#i3evu{padding:0px 832px 0px 0px;text-align:center;}#ib6kc{padding:0px 830px 0px 0px;}#iwcuv{padding:0px 832px 0px 0px;}#iwrlh{padding:0px 833px 0px 0px;}#ickhg{padding:0px 835px 0px 0px;}#inxyn{padding:0px 834px 0px 0px;}#iugll{padding:0px 837px 0px 0px;}#i38wv{padding:0px 834px 0px 0px;}#ic51j{padding:0px 831px 0px 0px;}#i6o1vq{padding:0px 834px 0px 0px;text-align:center;}#iqrqb9{padding:0px 834px 0px 0px;}#ivb58h{padding:0px 833px 0px 0px;}#i1tno6{padding:0px 827px 0px 0px;}#ijbg6a{padding:0px 832px 0px 0px;}#i9eawd{padding:0px 833px 0px 0px;}#ichvk{margin:0px 0px 0.5rem 0px;padding:0px 831px 0px 0px;text-align:center;}#iwmsy{padding:0px 835px 0px 0px;}#in0wu{padding:0px 836px 0px 0px;}#ip3dx{padding:0px 1145px 0px 15px;}#i9qdr{padding:0px 852px 0px 0px;text-align:center;}#iddbqr{padding:0px 827px 0px 0px;}#i779{padding:0px 780px 0px 0px;margin:0px 37px 0.5rem 0px;text-align:center;}#ig77j{padding:0px 0px 0px 20px;}}', '&lt;p id=&quot;ikbt&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ibkf&quot; class=&quot;container mt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;i779&quot;&gt;IKFC India Membership Guides:&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i81s&quot;&gt;Those boys and girls who complete the course from us up to Black Belt 3rd Dan can take membership to run a separate Kungfu training center, must have live membership card. Every coach must abide by the IKFC rules and regulation, IKFC members and students can participate in any games except Kungfu, Kungfu coaches must participate in every IKFC event.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i6bu&quot;&gt;IKFC Examination System: Every affiliated member can take the exam in his own club and association how to tale Color belt white, yellow, green, blue, red, brown, and black belt system 1st Dan black belt, 2nd Dan black belt, 3rd Dan black belt, 4th Dan black belt, 5thDan black belt, 6th Dan black belt, 7th Dan, black belt 8th Dan black belt, Those who complete the 3rd Dan black belt will receive a master’s degree and official training license. After completing 1st Dan black belt they will be able to do national and international referee/judge.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i7a4h&quot;&gt;IKFC Championship: Every year in December 30/31 the championship will be International, August/September all National and State Kungfu championship completed and June all Dist Kungfu championship completed, February Sub-Division Kungfu championship completed. The championships must be completed on this date.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iitn9&quot; class=&quot;container mt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;ig77j&quot;&gt;Want to be a Member?&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;if6gr&quot;&gt;Why not try our services today, you won&#039;t regret your choice! &lt;a href=&quot;https://internationalkungfucouncil.com/membership/#contact&quot; id=&quot;ity1y&quot;&gt;Contact Us Today&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;ichvk&quot;&gt;Benefits of IKFC India Membership:&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;imu9l&quot;&gt;The IKFC has designed a new membership registration system for National and International Style, any individuals from martial arts, of any background is eligible to apply for IKC membership. All registered National Secretary are authorized to give reorganization for State/Club affiliation and Color Belt Grading for individuals, Black Belt will be issued through IKFC International Headquarters in India&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;it9lk&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;is4co&quot;&gt;Note: &lt;/span&gt;IKFC will be authorized to conduct competition seminar and Referee, Judge Grade Certification. Style Directors are individual members of IKFC.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul id=&quot;ixq8c&quot;&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;iug3s&quot;&gt;National and International sport organizations be able to apply,&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;iwmsy&quot;&gt;All style, kung fu and Martial Arts organization&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;ig3it&quot;&gt;Wushu, Kickboxing, MMA, Muythai of health, culture, , sport, etc.,&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;is3uh&quot;&gt;international, national, regional and local Sport for All kung fu organizations,&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;i92ou&quot;&gt;Government and NGO organization can take direct membership,&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;ipygp&quot;&gt;School, educational institutions,&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;in0wu&quot;&gt;State District, Club Association be able to apply.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i1yv1&quot;&gt;&lt;i id=&quot;ip3dx&quot;&gt;REGISTER YOURSELF AND BECOME REGISTERES GOVERNING BODY!&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iwm5u&quot;&gt;IKFC members fall into two categories:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul id=&quot;i3ash&quot;&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;ivxu2&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iadkf&quot;&gt;1) State Members: &lt;/span&gt;This membership they will be able to take the international Black Belt exam and give the state membership, Can participate in every official tournament. The National International and World Continental championships, National and International referee judge and coach seminar can be organized. follow all IKFC rules&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;i8ygt&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iklgu&quot;&gt;2) State Governing Body  Members: &lt;/span&gt;The color belt and black belt certificate of their own association will be able to give, Will be able to championship with the name of their style, and develop your style. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ism9g&quot;&gt;For more details on the different member categories, please consult the &lt;span id=&quot;il6vq&quot;&gt;IKFC India&lt;/span&gt; Statutes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;i3evu&quot;&gt;What Benefit for Members And Its Students Will Get&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;igo5j&quot;&gt;Registered National Secretary &amp;amp; International Style Director gets a membership letter (E-letter) to Participate in the official games of any IKFC Events. It is only way to control that a member and its students has a right to play official games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ix6ni&quot;&gt;Registered Member Benefits:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ib6kc&quot;&gt;IKFC offers sports Kung fu Players Programs, Services, Opportunity and Benefits in the form of&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iwcuv&quot;&gt;Participation in risk-managed Organized Sports, IKFC Fight. And martial Arts IKFC Games Participation, per year, World 3 years 1time,Continental, Membership Certificate.IKC National body issue only state membership certificate, Player development program per year all martial arts games training seminar, Instructor development program only black belt member in your academy, IKFC Dan grading for all National Secretary &amp;amp; International Style Director,. Cash Award for IKFC Champion of Champion in International Category, Opportunities to Play in International Championships, Opportunities’ to Play Tournaments outside the Country, IKFC Certification will help get Scholarship for their Students in world level&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol id=&quot;ixufy&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iwrlh&quot;&gt;IKFC places the Sport for All Martial Arts on an international platform by giving Members a voice and ensuring their voices are heard.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;inxyn&quot;&gt;IKFC represents Members on international bodies, in global committees and working groups, and through partnerships spanning multiple sectors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ickhg&quot;&gt;IKFC Regional Bodies and Programmers’ are in place to focus on the specific continental needs of Members and support activities and Member development in each region.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iugll&quot;&gt;The IKFC Chairman, Board of Directors and Special Advisors visit Members on request and invitation to consult and politically support efforts in their country/region.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i38wv&quot;&gt;IKFC offers political support by providing relevant resources such as policy papers, scientific documents, calls for action, signing of declarations, etc.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;i9qdr&quot;&gt;Apply for IKFC Membership&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ic51j&quot;&gt;To become part of the ever-growing IKFC family, please complete and return the following application form, along with all the prescribed documents, to the IKFC office. Your application will be preliminary reviewed by the IKFC Board of Directors at its next meeting, and finally reviewed by the IKFC General Assembly at its next meeting on the occasion of the next IKFC World Congress.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;blink&quot; href=&quot;https://internationalkungfucouncil.com/membership/pay.php&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ixguzp&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Online Membership From&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;i6o1vq&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;We Will Accept Your Payment as A Donation&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iqrqb9&quot;&gt;Membership fees are due by 30th April each year and are &lt;span id=&quot;i0w9jh&quot;&gt;RS 5000&lt;/span&gt; State member per year and state governing body members &lt;span id=&quot;i7d5sw&quot;&gt;RS 2000&lt;/span&gt; per year or (This amount is applicable for State and Governing body membership for developing the game Over State! )&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;ivb58h&quot;&gt;Together We are Strong... the more registered National / Style Under IKC have, The better is International Recognition for the game Over World Wide !&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;h5 id=&quot;i1tno6&quot;&gt;There are two options to pay your IKFC membership fee:&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;ijhcop&quot;&gt;1) Bank Transfer:&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ijbg6a&quot;&gt;Please transfer your fee to the bank account below. Please reference your member number in the transaction description.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;iprtzc&quot;&gt;IKFC Bank Account Details:&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul id=&quot;iudlj9&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Receiver:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Bank:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Account No.:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Swift Code:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;IFSC Code.:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;iddbqr&quot;&gt;Reference/Transaction Description:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul id=&quot;i4ru5x&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;i0bt5h&quot;&gt;INTERNATIONAL KUNGFU COUNCIL&lt;br/&gt;BANK OF INDIA&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;i5x2fy&quot;&gt;420520110000303&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;BKIDINBBCCB&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;BKID0004205&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;DONATION&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;igcnla&quot;&gt;2) Razor pay:&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i9eawd&quot;&gt;You can use Razor pay account at your convenience, The &lt;span id=&quot;ia602v&quot;&gt;INTRENATIONAL KUNGFU COUNCIL&lt;/span&gt; thinks about its own members, &lt;a href=&quot;https://rzp.io/l/zVY0Kbm&quot; id=&quot;i0ct3g&quot;&gt;www.razorpay.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 29, '1', '2024-04-19 15:52:43', '2024-05-02 15:15:15'),
(264, 428, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}#i4iq{margin:0px 10px 0px 10px;color:black;font-family:Georgia, serif;}#ijkk{margin:0px 10px 0px 10px;color:#1a00bc;font-size:20px;font-family:Georgia, serif;}#ic67s{color:black;width:100%;}', '&lt;body id=&quot;ii3u&quot;&gt;&lt;img id=&quot;ic67s&quot; src=&quot;https://enwpgo.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/aboutus-aboutme.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ijkk&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;About Chickoo&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i4iq&quot;&gt;Smart Brain Child Was Established In India Since 2009 And Has Been Providing The Latest In Educational Methodologies. We, Being The Direct Distributor Of ?skill Development Modules? Help Schools To Educate, Entertain, And Motivate Their Students By Providing Quality Products.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;We Rely On To Encourage The Modern Learning &amp;amp; Development Programs For Kids Where School And Teachers Play A Vital Role In Overall Progress Of Children. And Their Investment In Strong Development Is A Critical Strategy For Ensuring That All Children Are Ready To Learn And Be Successful In School And In Life. Furthermore, By Bringing Schools And Parents Together, We Would Be Successful In Improving And Achieving The Academic And Social Success For Children.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Our Aim&lt;/b&gt; Is To Recommend And Provide The Research-based Skill Modules To Make Everyone Aware About The Importance Of Early Years Learning By Focusing On The Four Key Pillars Of Development I.e.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;a. LANGUAGE&lt;br/&gt;b. KNOWLEDGE&lt;br/&gt;c. IQ&lt;br/&gt;d. CREATIVITY&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;And On The Basis Of Above, Our Products Focus On Developing Or Enhancing The Multiple Intelligence Skills In A Child.&lt;br/&gt;These Research-based Modules Are Designed Or Developed By Renowned Child?s Psychologist To Nurture The High Order Thinking Skills (hots) In Kids By Emphasising On:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;* Critical Thinking Skills&lt;br/&gt;* Problem Solving Skills&lt;br/&gt;* Enhancing Imagination Power&lt;br/&gt;* Over Coming Fixed Beliefs&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;HOTS Has Been Globally Renowned As A Refined Way Of Teaching In Indian Education Market To Ensure An Organised Learning And Generalised Benefit.&lt;br/&gt;250+ Happy School Customer.&lt;br/&gt;500+ Innovative Products.&lt;/p&gt;', 38, '1', '2024-04-17 10:42:50', '2024-04-17 10:46:03'),
