n:var(--bs-body-text-align);}#i786{margin:0px 10px 0px 10px;font-size:25px;color:#ea0000;}#i4c1-2{--tw-border-spacing-x:0;--tw-border-spacing-y:0;--tw-translate-x:0;--tw-translate-y:0;--tw-rotate:0;--tw-skew-x:0;--tw-skew-y:0;--tw-scale-x:1;--tw-scale-y:1;--tw-scroll-snap-strictness:proximity;--tw-ring-offset-width:0px;--tw-ring-offset-color:#fff;--tw-ring-color:rgba(69,89,164,.5);--tw-ring-offset-shadow:0 0 transparent;--tw-ring-shadow:0 0 transparent;--tw-shadow:0 0 transparent;--tw-shadow-colored:0 0 transparent;}@media (max-width: 992px){#ip7g{height:300px;}}@media (max-width: 768px){.row{flex-wrap:wrap;}}@media (max-width: 480px){#ip7g{height:150px;}}', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot; id=&quot;ip7g&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot; id=&quot;imij&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i786&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i4c1-2&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iacx&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About Us: Appliances Shop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ismc&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i4c1&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iap1r&quot;&gt;Welcome to Appliances Shop, your one-stop destination for all your home appliance needs. We are dedicated to providing high-quality appliances from leading brands to enhance your home and simplify your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iuegl&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i82eg&quot;&gt;Our Story&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iu8ee&quot;&gt;At Appliances Shop, we understand the importance of reliable and efficient home appliances. Our journey began with a vision to offer a curated selection of products that combine innovation, durability, and affordability. Whether you are setting up a new home or upgrading your existing appliances, we are here to guide you every step of the way.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ibqpw&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iza9v&quot;&gt;Our Mission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i2hhi&quot;&gt;Our mission is to exceed customer expectations by offering a seamless shopping experience and top-notch customer service. We strive to be the preferred choice for home appliances by consistently delivering quality products and personalized assistance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;izk2y&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ixf9r&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul id=&quot;ioxpn&quot;&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;iz297&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ibwao&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;it3yc&quot;&gt;Wide Selection&lt;/span&gt;: Explore our extensive range of appliances including refrigerators, washing machines, dishwashers, ovens, air conditioners, and more. We carefully select each product to ensure it meets our standards of performance and value.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;ikni7&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ixi3m&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iwnve&quot;&gt;Top Brands&lt;/span&gt;: We partner with trusted brands known for their commitment to excellence. Rest assured, all our products are sourced from reputable manufacturers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;i6sgi&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i76jp&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;imvxm&quot;&gt;Competitive Prices&lt;/span&gt;: Enjoy competitive pricing without compromising on quality. We regularly update our offerings to provide the best deals and promotions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;itlxj&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i6stk&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iirod&quot;&gt;Expert Advice&lt;/span&gt;: Our knowledgeable team is here to assist you in choosing the right appliances based on your requirements and budget. Whether you need recommendations or technical support, we are just a call or message away.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;ir3qb&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ihpaf&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;igwao&quot;&gt;Convenience&lt;/span&gt;: Shop conveniently from the comfort of your home through our user-friendly website. We offer flexible payment options and efficient delivery services.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 32, '1', '2024-04-06 13:33:52', '2024-04-06 13:34:27'),
