cordion&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our service offerings to enhance customer experience throughout the product lifecycle includes – test and repair, service management, and end-to-end warranty management. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- Start toggles --&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;toggles-wrapper section-space--pt_90&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ipgaf&quot; class=&quot;faq-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section-elements-title mb-30&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;i5vbe&quot;&gt;INQUIRY FORM&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;faq-toggles&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;faq_1&quot; class=&quot;card-header&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 class=&quot;mb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;faq_one&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;faq_1&quot; class=&quot;collapse show&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iwgqtl&quot;&gt;[ab-form id=350]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;faq_2&quot; class=&quot;card-header&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 class=&quot;mb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;faq_two&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;faq_2&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mitech takes into consideration every little detail to make sure the system run smoothly and responsively. Mitech employs a new technique called Minified Technology for securing customers&#039; database &amp;amp; building up highly confidential firewalls. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;faq_3&quot; class=&quot;card-header&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 class=&quot;mb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;faq_three&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;faq_3&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We reduce redundant complex calculations and lengthy erroneous code texts with simpler ones to ensure Mitech would run seamlessly and the design is reserved in its best form when viewed from a wide range of mobile devices &amp;amp; browsers. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;faq_4&quot; class=&quot;card-header&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 class=&quot;mb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;faq_four&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;faq_4&quot; data-bs-parent=&quot;#faq-toggles&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are available to freelance hiring with on-demand extra services, including WordPress site design/ redesign, WordPress installation, all-in-one customization, video production, video editing and stop motion video producing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- End toggles --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--====================  Accordion area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  Accordion area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  Accordion area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--========== Call to Action Area Start ============--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i9k1c6&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe frameborder=&quot;0&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d14659.264450458442!2d77.4037783!3d23.2861305!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x397c694a893ef1e5%3A0x15350d3afb2cd168!2sIdrees%20hone%20wall%20painting!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1713699646502!5m2!1sen!2sin&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; height=&quot;450&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer-when-downgrade&quot; id=&quot;ioujdg&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cta-image-area_one section-space--ptb_80 cta-bg-image_one&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-xl-8 col-lg-7&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cta-content md-text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading text-white&quot;&gt;Assess your business potentials and find opportunities &lt;span class=&quot;text-color-secondary&quot;&gt;for bigger success&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-xl-4 col-lg-5&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cta-button-group--one text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;tel:+919644158090&quot; id=&quot;irn9zd&quot; class=&quot;btn btn--white btn-one&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;btn-icon me-2&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;far fa-comment-alt&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Let&#039;s talk&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://idreeshomewallpainting.com/page/About-Us&quot; id=&quot;i88sfq&quot; class=&quot;btn btn--secondary btn-two&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;btn-icon me-2&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fas fa-info-circle&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Get info&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--========== Call to Action Area End ============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 35, '1', '2024-04-09 13:11:57', '2024-04-21 13:03:38');
