b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i4kwxn&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;center&quot; id=&quot;ikko9o&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;itdgke&quot;&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;2&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; id=&quot;ijtjll&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iw6d7b&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iz1r4-2&quot; draggable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i18i6s-2&quot; draggable=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;&gt;DF-Maker &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Develop Video &amp;amp; Photo Designing\nSoftware?s which Helps Wedding Photographers to edit their wedding film editing\nin very easily with less time. DF Maker develop projects for DF Maker Software\nand?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i6j1sj&quot;&gt;DF Maker&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ifzty4&quot;&gt;?Pro is best perfect finishing tool for wedding video and also for\ndocumentary, news, corporate and studio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; id=&quot;ilgsd5&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i18i6s&quot;&gt;DF Maker Created A Projects Bundle Pack   DF Maker Gold Projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i1dyro&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; id=&quot;ise69u&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i2skcl&quot;&gt;DF-Maker Gold are ready made video projects.\nIt&#039;s a home production of DF Maker.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i3glzw&quot;&gt;DF Maker &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iodxb2&quot;&gt;Gold with Choose A Effect ?\nTransitions &amp;amp; Filters. We are serving in DF Maker Gold Projects series\nwith ready made all functions projects. You will find a variety of readymade\nprojects ? Wedding Reels, Teaser, Wedding Highlights, Portrait Songs, Cinematic\nTitle, Birthday Highlights, Pre-weddings, Pre-wedding teaser, Save the date,\nStudio Logos, Online Vidhi projects and lots of editing utilities with\nunlimited video backgrounds, effects, music and Luts.?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iej4i9&quot;&gt;DF Maker?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;itlpou&quot;&gt;Gold is compatible\nwith all versions of?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i7qoci&quot;&gt;DF Maker?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;if6mzj&quot;&gt;Software.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;immv33&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; id=&quot;ih9sfs&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iea29g&quot;&gt;Video &amp;amp; Photo Designing Software&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iik4hh&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; id=&quot;iccqqz&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;itan87&quot;&gt;We have all elements, effects &amp;amp; graphics for\nmake your cinematic wedding more attractive. This is all ready to use?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i02x0g&quot;&gt;DF Maker?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;igdcg2&quot;&gt;Wedding Projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iswwli&quot;&gt;. In just few mins you can\nready your own wedding highlights &amp;amp; teaser.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i9hfni&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; id=&quot;ie6hsd&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iv3j4j&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i8uw2a&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i0c6e&quot;&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iqspma&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iwmq7s&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iroa8&quot;&gt;[AB-Slider id=281]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i5sl1g&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iylnyo&quot; class=&quot;fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-3 nonhundred-percent-fullwidth