div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 id=&quot;i4l3el-2&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;ihq1la-2&quot;&gt;Anti Termite Treatment (Pre &amp;amp; Post Construction )\n                            &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i2anwh-2&quot; class=&quot;text&quot;&gt;BBPCX offers both residential and commercial termite control services. Serving as the largest\n                          &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://bbpcx.com/page/Contact-Us&quot; id=&quot;in1uh6&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md&quot;&gt;Send Inquiry&lt;/a&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon End --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-3 col-md-6&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon Start --&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ht-box-icon style-01 single-svg-icon-box&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;icon-box-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;img draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://www.pepcopp.co.in/images/pest-control/pest-innerpage/rodent-control.jpg&quot; id=&quot;is8x9l-2&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 id=&quot;i1e7tf-2&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;ioxscy-2&quot;&gt;Rodent control service\n                            &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ih3j59-2&quot; class=&quot;text&quot;&gt;Some pests are small and more often than now, out of our way. As for rodents, it becomes a bit scary to even enter our homes if we\n                          &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://bbpcx.com/page/Contact-Us&quot; id=&quot;idp41y&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md&quot;&gt;Send Inquiry&lt;/a&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon End --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 39, '1', '2024-04-18 09:56:12', '2024-04-22 11:33:23'),
(271, 434, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}#iu3f9i{width:100%;}#ibfft{text-align:var(--bs-body-text-align);}#initb{margin-top:12.0pt;}#ib6n4{font-size:20px;text-align:center;}#i6qqy{font-weight:bold;}#i078e{text-align:var(--bs-body-text-align);}#if0esr{margin:0.05in 0in 0.1in;}#iyua9q{font-family:Montserrat, &quot;serif&quot;;color:black;}#ivrrkh{text-align:var(--bs-body-text-align);}#ifm95{width:556px;}', '&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper position-relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container service-slider__container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;img id=&quot;iu3f9i&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://enwpgo.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/aboutus-aboutme.jpg&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;it623&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ii8zj&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.freepik.com/premium-vector/pest-control-service-with-exterminator-insects-flat-cartoon-background-illustration_2175-5946.jpg&quot; height=&quot;709&quot; width=&quot;811&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ifm95&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i6ss1&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;ib6n4&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;BlazonBrite Pest CtrlX System : &lt;br/&gt;Where every pest is eradicated with scientific and innovative approach!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ieucl&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;icuwf&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i4eiq&quot;&gt;BlazonBrite Pest CtrlX System &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ibfft&quot;&gt;is one of the emerging\nstart-up of innovative commercial and residential pest control, fumigation and\nsanitization service providers who bring a higher level of professionalism to\nthe pest control industry by our experienced service group – The Company has\nentered the marketplace to provide essential proactive pest elimination\nservices. We offer a wide range of solution to a diverse spectrum of customers.\n&lt;b&gt;We serve prestigious, commercial offices, shopping mall, manufacturing unit,\nproduction plant, agriculture warehouses, modest housing society or residential\nbuilding. &lt;/b&gt;The services we render are always of optimum quality. BBPCS has come\nto be recognized as one of the Delhi-NCR leading of pest management &amp;amp;\nfumigation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;itx1i&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;u id=&quot;iaryj&quot;&gt;&lt;u id=&quot;i6qqy&quot;&gt;Our Mission:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;if0esr&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iyua9q&quot;&gt;Our journey began with a dream nurtured by the brilliance of\nIIT-IIM alumni. BBPCX aims to redefine Pest control management system. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ivrrkh&quot;&gt;Our mission is to protect what our clients value most- Family, Health, Property and Reputation - By creating customer experiences that exceed all expectations of professionalism, integrity, responsiveness and effectiveness.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i078e&quot;&gt;&lt;i id=&quot;i1qbz&quot;&gt;Our motto is to make possible safe termination of pests by non hazardous  and natural methods.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;initb&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iwycn&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u id=&quot;ipoe1&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Our Vision:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Our vision is to provide peace of mind to our community by protecting and preserving health and profiting by eradicating pests. We always try to be renowned service provider and to remain on &lt;b&gt;T.R.A.C.K.  &lt;/b&gt;in order to achieve excellence in the pest control industry at large. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;We will always:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;T&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;each and develop our team to be second to none.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;R&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;efine our craft continuously by seeking out the very latest technology methodology and educational advancement opportunities&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;A&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;l&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;ways intend to do the right thing by our employees, clients, community, and the environment&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;C&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;ommunicate at a high level with one another and clients alike to foster transparency, nurture positive experiences, and efficiently resolve challenges&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;K&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;eep our employees’ best interests in mind while making organizational decisions for our collective success in the present and future&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 39, '1', '2024-04-18 09:23:41', '2024-05-01 12:29:07'),
