copyable-text x1sdyfia x1ncwhqj xd4r4e8 x1n8ftqi&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i1yqw5-2&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Having strong goals and objectives will assist with knowing when you should be happy with the trading algo.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span data-plain-text=&quot;*&quot; id=&quot;iuiy7i&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text x1sdyfia x1ncwhqj xd4r4e8 x1n8ftqi&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iadvy6&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Know about the market you want to trade.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span data-plain-text=&quot;*&quot; id=&quot;ityumt&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text x1sdyfia x1ncwhqj xd4r4e8 x1n8ftqi&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ilmufa&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;The yearly return and draw down you want.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;heading__13&quot; class=&quot;card-header&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 class=&quot;mb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;collapse__13&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;heading__13&quot; data-bs-parent=&quot;#accordion_two&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our service offerings to enhance customer experience throughout the product lifecycle includes – test and repair, service management, and end-to-end warranty management. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i0eket&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- Start toggles --&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;toggles-wrapper section-space--pt_90&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;faq-two-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section-elements-title mb-30&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;faq-toggles-2&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;toggles_15&quot; class=&quot;card-header&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 class=&quot;mb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;faq_15&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;toggles_15&quot; class=&quot;collapse show&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ikyijx&quot; class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;imsnyo&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i3bem&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;MQL Development&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;We use MetaTrader Software to make automated trading softwares and financial market indicators.&lt;br/&gt;Create a custom technical indicator.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span data-plain-text=&quot;*&quot; id=&quot;iuzng6&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text x1sdyfia x1ncwhqj xd4r4e8 x1n8ftqi&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ity1zu&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Get high quality leads with MQL.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span data-plain-text=&quot;*&quot; id=&quot;ivqzsg&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text x1sdyfia x1ncwhqj xd4r4e8 x1n8ftqi&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i1wiek&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Tweak an existing indicator.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span data-plain-text=&quot;*&quot; id=&quot;iail0k&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text x1sdyfia x1ncwhqj xd4r4e8 x1n8ftqi&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ibxzxj&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Develop a fully functional Expert Advisor.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span data-plain-text=&quot;*&quot; id=&quot;i5kfcw&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text x1sdyfia x1ncwhqj xd4r4e8 x1n8ftqi&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i04ru2&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Generate automated signals for entries&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span data-plain-text=&quot;*&quot; id=&quot;iqqny5&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text x1sdyfia x1ncwhqj xd4r4e8 x1n8ftqi&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;icxo0k&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Adding alerts, or chart visuals.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span data-plain-text=&quot;*&quot; id=&quot;ik8lk4&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text x1sdyfia x1ncwhqj xd4r4e8 x1n8ftqi&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i1yqw5&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Back test your current trading strategy.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;API Bridge is a set of programming interface, pincode and Places is first programming interface right now. APIBridge permits you to algo trade with various stages like Amibroker, MT4, TradingView, Python, Excel, NinjaTrader and so on.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i9m8sa&quot;&gt;API Bridge&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ili7mo&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;API Bridge is a set of programming interface, pincode and Places is first programming interface right now. APIBridge permits you to algo trade with various stages like Amibroker, MT4, TradingView, Python, Excel, NinjaTrader and so on.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;toggles_18&quot; class=&quot;card-header&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 class=&quot;mb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;faq_18&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;toggles_18&quot; data-bs-parent=&quot;#faq-toggles&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are available to freelance hiring with on-demand extra services, including WordPress site design/ redesign, WordPress installation, all-in-one customization, video production, video editing and stop motion video producing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- End toggles --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 43, '1', '2024-02-07 11:18:42', '2024-05-01 05:11:09');
INSERT INTO `ab_page_content` (`id`, `page_id`, `cssdata`, `content`, `admin_id`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(343, 515, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}#iu3f9i{width:100%;}#ipys{margin:0px 10px 0px 10px;font-size:16px;}#ir8j5{margin:0px 10px 0px 10px;font-size:16px;}#i0uqm{color:rgb(155, 155, 155);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:15px;}#icfbp{color:#000000;margin:0px 10px 0px 10px;font-size:20px;}#i8229{font-size:25px;color:#b80000;margin:0 0 0 10px;}#ilx88{font-size:20px;color:#000000;margin:0px 10px 0px 10px;}#i86r2{color:#000000;margin:0px 10px 0px 10px;font-size:20px;}', '&lt;img id=&quot;iu3f9i&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://www.godrejpestcontrol.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/8.jpg&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ipys&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ilx88&quot;&gt;As the masses are becoming more and more conscious about environment and health , the demand for our Herbal Termite Control services is picking up. These days we are getting fair number of call in our Delhi and Noida office about these sevices, whereby Homeowners ask one common question “How Effective is Herbal Pest Control treatment ?”&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Homeowners have a concern while hiring us for herbal termite treatment for their property in Delhi NCR. They want to be well informed about the the herbal products that we intend to use and their efficacy While other Herbal termite control companies try to hide the name of herbal product by labeling it is “Trade Secret” , we believe that customer has a right to know the name of herbal pesticides that is going to be used on their property as the health of their loved ones is involved&lt;/p&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i8229&quot;&gt;Herbal Termiticide&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;icfbp&quot;&gt;In this section of website we try to educate the homeowners about Herbal Termiticide product, it’s efficacy and it’s application. We feel proud in introducing Genuine Herbal Pest Control Services in Delhi NCR. As we constantly partner with our customers, we are able to suggest the most effective treatment techniques as per their requirement. We believe that balancing your family’s health and your safety is a matter you should have a say in. All pests, rodents and insects can be successfully controlled using Herbal or natural pest control techniques. You may name it whatever you like, Natural Pest Control , Herbal pest control . Enough Research and development has been done and now it’s time that you can safely consider Herbal Pest Control Services for your business and home in Gurgaon.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i86r2&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;iqza2&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Herbal pest control program&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;By using botanical and essential oils derived from herbs under our Herbal pest control program, we use nature’s insecticide to treat your property in an environmentally responsible manner. As a responsible, company professional, and accredited pest control company in Delhi NCR region we are constantly striving to improve our Herbal pest control service by utilizing the latest technologies available. We only use natural products, which contain a blend of essential oils that effectively target a broad spectrum of pests which are friendly to the living environment of your home . How great it would be if, instead of using those nostril-stinging smell of bug insecticides or obnoxious fumes, the only sign that you were battling pests was a sweet aroma of the lemon grass?&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Organic Pest Control solutions&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The demand for Organic Pest Control solutions in the past few years has helped us to propel ourselves into the competing world of “Chemical-free” Pest Control market and expand across Delhi NCR. Some of the herbal pesticides that we use for Natural Pest control are :-&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Neem Oil for Cockroach and ants control services.&lt;br/&gt;Metarhizium anisopliae for Natural Termite Control&lt;br/&gt;Cedar oil for Termite and wood borer control.&lt;br/&gt;Lemon grass and Citronilla oil for Mosquito control.&lt;br/&gt;Mint oil for common household pests.&lt;br/&gt;Cashew Nut shell oil for Termite treatment.&lt;br/&gt;Diatomaceous earth for Black/Red Ants control.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;How they work&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;When insects and other arthropods are exposed to naturally occuring organic pesticides, the aroma overwhelms their breathing system and triggers a suicide response—the spiracles (breathing pores) close and cannot re-open. These formulations also dissolves the insect eggs and larvae, eliminating the next generation of arthropod, while the aroma of Cedar disrupts their pheromone signals and creates a barrier of entry to newly arriving pests. Our organic pest control product helps get rid of roaches, ants, centipedes, spiders, fleas, ticks, bed bugs, earwigs, silverfish, mites, flies and other bugs on contact, leaving a pleasant aroma. No harmful chemicals – Just food grade aromatic natural ingredients. These naturally derived herbal pesticides kills bugs on contact and continues to work as a repellent for hours after application. This product is safe for pets, children and elderly people and can be used to control flea and tick infestations, ant and roach infestations, and even bedbug or mite infestations.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ir8j5&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i0uqm&quot; class=&quot;cms-heading-extra-space extra-space&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 39, '1', '2024-04-29 13:03:18', '2024-04-29 13:11:03'),
