 id=&quot;main-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper position-relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container service-slider__container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ilnac&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;ixyqz&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iasgn&quot;&gt;FRENCH LANGUAGE TRAINING&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ivxrj&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ikh5b&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;i4ewc&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;il2t9&quot;&gt;Learning French offers a lot of benefits to both personal and professional growth if pursued alongside a college degree. It is the second most widely learned language after English and the sixth most widely spoken language in the world. More than 220 million people in the world speak French.  It is the official language in many international organizations such as the International Olympic Committee, United Nations, FIFA, and UNESCO. It is spoken in 40 different countries and European territories including, Africa, North America, Antarctica, and Oceania. It is an International Language. Every year, more than 5,000 Indian students enroll in French institutes, universities, and business schools with an hope to get scholarship. One can work in various industries on a smart salary package. Possible growing industries that anyone can opt or for after completing. These are some of the job opportunities one can get with proficiency in the French language. Apart from these, one can also work in foreign embassies. If you have a good level of certification then you can learn huge money in the sitting of the comfort of home. Following are the roles that you can consider as a French language expert- &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;idcc3&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;i25ga&quot;&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ibsqr&quot;&gt;· &lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ibfrj&quot;&gt;Freelancer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ijfli&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;ivv6s&quot;&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ii03j&quot;&gt;· &lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ib8c9&quot;&gt;Content Writer/Translator/Editor/Proofreader&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i45cq&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;ipcg4&quot;&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iziok&quot;&gt;· &lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ijeye&quot;&gt;Tour Guide&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ip28l&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;iom0j&quot;&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ic7np&quot;&gt;· &lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i8341&quot;&gt;Journalist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;itrsq&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;ix1zr&quot;&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ifjyx&quot;&gt;· &lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i000n&quot;&gt;Teacher&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;igjol&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;io79g&quot;&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;id98q&quot;&gt;· &lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iwzuq&quot;&gt;Public Relation Officer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iaeph&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;iutzi&quot;&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iiitx&quot;&gt;· &lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ii5rd&quot;&gt;The representative of Foreign Companies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;idoq9&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;iru1ao&quot;&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ithab2&quot;&gt;· &lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i4iwni&quot;&gt;Research associates &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ix3cwi&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 28, '1', '2024-04-29 05:23:53', '2024-04-29 05:23:53');
