ea-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ie0el&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;igw9y&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iljhw&quot;&gt;CV &amp;amp; RESUME MAKING&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iy053&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ipxh6&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;izfap&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ipdq7&quot;&gt;A resume plays an important role in the job application process and has the potential to make a positive impression on the prospective employer. It summarizes the job seeker’s required experience and qualifications for a job thus clarifying the significance of how well organized a resume must be to hit the desired job. However, having a well-tailored resume becomes more essential nowadays with respect to the fact that online job postings routinely attract hundreds and no doubt thousands of applications. A highly skilled individual might not be able to express himself while preparing for their &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/R%C3%A9sum%C3%A9&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i9pha&quot;&gt;resume&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iynm8&quot;&gt; as professionally as it is expected, but at this institute &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;isgxj&quot;&gt;res&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i5ja1&quot;&gt;ume writers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ia5rv&quot;&gt; work effectively to highlight one’s personal skills into professional standards to enhance the overall value and efficiency of the resume. Not only this, but the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i86li&quot;&gt;resume writing service&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i4ee4&quot;&gt; keep in mind to provide the job seekers with excellent resumes to make a difference with others resume and hence to take their careers to the next level of growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iuipq&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;i3r11&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i5bms&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;icc25&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;ig24s&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ie3bf&quot;&gt;Our team help you to create an outstanding resume that would be noticed by a recruiter it is presented too. It is obvious that a recruiter does not give much time to look at each and every resume and utilizes a few seconds only for the analysis. Therefore, our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iltha&quot;&gt;professional resume writer services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iz4b5&quot;&gt; make sure to include the most required and relevant information to give every job seeker the best possible chance of resume getting selected.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ix434&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;i64kq&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iae8q&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ibnpo&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;itton&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iz1dr&quot;&gt;We have a team of highly experienced &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i1grs&quot;&gt;professional resume writers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;isdi8&quot;&gt; who make your resume the great one among all the good ones. We are also available with our experts to check and correct your already-existing resume and upgrade its quality. So, we are always there for you to create, improve, edit and correct your resume to make sure that you are presented in the best possible way and get you the ideal job.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i5gmz&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;iv1jg&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ifghk&quot;&gt;This institute has an impressive track record of successfully landing clients jobs at top companies in India. This institute is going to be a member of the Professional Association of Resume Writers &amp;amp; Career Coaches (PARW/CC) very soon.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iggcx&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 28, '1', '2024-04-29 05:27:48', '2024-04-29 05:27:48'),
(340, 512, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}#icwig{margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:150%;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;}#ix62g{font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;line-height:150%;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size:14pt;}#ifwvv{font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;line-height:150%;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size:14pt;}#iw7jg{margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:150%;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;}#iuq0i{mso-spacerun:&#039;yes&#039;;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;;line-height:150%;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;}#i4qql{mso-spacerun:&#039;yes&#039;;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;;line-height:150%;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;}#ij0jy{margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:150%;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;}#il3mk{mso-spacerun:&#039;yes&#039;;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;;line-height:150%;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;}#iih7o{mso-spacerun:&#039;yes&#039;;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;;line-height:150%;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;}#ielf2{margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:150%;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;}#i7reu{mso-spacerun:&#039;yes&#039;;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;;line-height:150%;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;}#ifgla{mso-spacerun:&#039;yes&#039;;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;;line-height:150%;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;}', '&lt;body id=&quot;igao&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper position-relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container service-slider__container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i5v8d&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;icwig&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ix62g&quot;&gt;JOB PLACEMENT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ifwvv&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i14ij&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;iw7jg&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iuq0i&quot;&gt;Many Companies contact us who need a new workforce for their organization, first have to contact the staffing agency and tells about type of open position, number of employees required, skills needed qualifications, etc. Then we put the job description. And advertise the job via recruitment marketing efforts on their own websites, other job boards, and social media sites. Candidates see the job advertised on websites or other channels. Candidates make conversation with their recruiter on this and then fill out the application if it is a suitable one for the candidate. Once we collects the application of potential candidates, goes for interview screening, according to the type of job interview that takes place. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i4qql&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;ij0jy&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;il3mk&quot;&gt;We manages the end-to-end process and with expertise saves time of employers, our services are making them stress free and it is cost effective too&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iih7o&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;ielf2&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i7reu&quot;&gt;We are capable of providing various types of employees for the position like temporary hires, permanent employees, task-based employees, and so on. We also contributes by assisting the companies in various other areas like applicant tracking, pre-employment assessment test, scheduling interview, selection, on boarding, planning for the future recruit, contribute to job description bullet points etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ifgla&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 28, '1', '2024-04-29 05:33:09', '2024-04-29 05:33:09'),
(341, 513, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}#i7ctg{margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:150%;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;}#ig8f5{font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;line-height:150%;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size:14pt;}#ipwgi{font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;line-height:150%;color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size:14pt;}#ixs8b{margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:150%;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;}#ikj8o{mso-spacerun:&#039;yes&#039;;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;;line-height:150%;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;}#iby2p{mso-spacerun:&#039;yes&#039;;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;;line-height:150%;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;}#ivqnq{margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:150%;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;}#if6kz{mso-spacerun:&#039;yes&#039;;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;;line-height:150%;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;}#iebfl{mso-spacerun:&#039;yes&#039;;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;;line-height:150%;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;}#i0cf1{margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:150%;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;}#idwdd{mso-spacerun:&#039;yes&#039;;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;;line-height:150%;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;}#ieg3s{margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:150%;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;}#iuate{mso-spacerun:&#039;yes&#039;;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;;line-height:150%;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;}#irmji{mso-spacerun:&#039;yes&#039;;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;;line-height:150%;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:14.0000pt;}', '&lt;body id=&quot;ilz8&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper position-relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container service-slider__container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iqmmj&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;i7ctg&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ig8f5&quot;&gt;COLLEGE ADMISSION WITH JOB GUARANTEE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ipwgi&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i6on5&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;ixs8b&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ikj8o&quot;&gt;Here every year around 1000 schools are visited where career counselling session is provided to the students from Maths, biology, arts, commerce and agriculture streams. At the same time student name and contact number is collected from each school. Thanks letter is sent to principals of all school&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iby2p&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;ivqnq&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;if6kz&quot;&gt;Then before their 10 plus 2 board exam, our dedicated team of telecallers contact them and request them to save number of consultancy. After board exams, with the help of social media tools they are requested to take admission in various professional courses in various colleges after visiting our offices at Jaipur, Ajmer, Udaipur and Chittorgarh with parents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iebfl&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;i0cf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;idwdd&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; id=&quot;ieg3s&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iuate&quot;&gt;Scholarship schemes are explained to eligible candidates to all stream students. As we have very sound relation with HR department professional of various organizations so 100 percent job assistance is given to students to make them employable in companies of following industries-Information Technology (IT), Tech, Healthcare, .Education, Accounting, Pharmaceutical, Finance, Engineering, Real Estate, Higher Education, Sales, Government, Energy, Retail, Manufacturing, Architecture, Human Resources, Nonprofit, Transportation, Hospitality, Logistics, Merchant Banking, Insurance etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;irmji&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 28, '1', '2024-04-29 05:37:17', '2024-04-29 05:37:17');
INSERT INTO `ab_page_content` (`id`, `page_id`, `cssdata`, `content`, `admin_id`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
