terest rates &amp;amp; choose wisely whichever suits you best. Our financial teams are professional and dedicated to find the best loan deals. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://dhanifinanceandinsurance.in/page/About-Us&quot; id=&quot;i8sqe9&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md&quot;&gt;Read more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ikpi1n&quot; class=&quot;fun-fact-wrapper bg-gray section-space--pb_30 section-space--pt_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-md-4 col-sm-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact--four text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;far fa-smile-beam&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact-text&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact__count counter&quot;&gt;1790&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h6 class=&quot;fun-fact__text&quot;&gt;Happy clients&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-md-4 col-sm-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact--four text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;far fa-folder&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact-text&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact__count counter&quot;&gt;920&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h6 class=&quot;fun-fact__text&quot;&gt;Finished projects&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-md-4 col-sm-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact--four text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;far fa-user&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact-text&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact__count counter&quot;&gt;245&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h6 class=&quot;fun-fact__text