 brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iw3fef&quot; class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper bg-gray section-space--ptb_100&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-12&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- section-title-wrap Start --&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section-title-wrap text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 id=&quot;ih1vd3&quot; class=&quot;section-sub-title mb-20&quot;&gt;What We’re Offering&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;ipit17&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;All Loans Services ---&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- section-title-wrap Start --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-12&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images__one&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iiglg6&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-4 col-md-6 wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon Start --&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ht-box-images style-01&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ic4smk&quot; class=&quot;image-box-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;box-image&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://images.news18.com/ibnlive/uploads/2024/01/news18-bl-zb-2024-01-4fe9a2440d19ff7c57f54bbcbf082503-3x2.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ivzpjq&quot; class=&quot;img-fulid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 id=&quot;ihn43v&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;immzgq&quot;&gt;Personal Loan &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i1s2ah&quot; class=&quot;text&quot;&gt;Get instant personal loan upto Rs.25 lakh with minimal documentation. With top banking partners, we offer instant personal loans for salaried people with less interest. Get your loan amount credit in 24 hours with pledging.\n                                                    &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;circle-arrow&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;middle-dot&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;middle-dot dot-2&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://dhanifinanceandinsurance.in/page/Contact-Us&quot; id=&quot;its7lq&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fas fa-arrow-right&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon End --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iukfuf&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-4 col-md-6 wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon Start --&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ht-box-images style-01&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;image-box-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;box-image&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.dnaindia.com/sites/default/files/styles/full/public/2018/11/28/759231-loaneducation-thinkstock-041018.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;iopvpz&quot; class=&quot;img-fulid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 id=&quot;idtgky&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i6f5sd&quot;&gt;Education Loan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i6q5ov&quot; class=&quot;text&quot;&gt;With minimal documentation and quick approval, you can easily avail education loans to pay all the education costs of your child. Our education loans are available for both indian and abroad students.\n                                                    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;circle-arrow&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;middle-dot&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;middle-dot dot-2&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://dhanifinanceandinsurance.in/page/Contact-Us&quot; id=&quot;ir1q6r&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fas fa-arrow-right&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon End --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ijkh0h&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-4 col-md-6 wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon Start --&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ht-box-images style-01&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;image-box-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;box-image&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;data:image/jpeg;base64,&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;iya949&quot; class=&quot;img-fulid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 id=&quot;iechp4&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;iqunqi&quot;&gt;Business Loan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ipftuj&quot; class=&quot;text&quot;&gt;SME business loans have been specially designed for “small and medium enterprises”. With our quick and secure SME business loans, you can either start your own business or invest in your existing business.\n                                                    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;circle-arrow&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;middle-dot&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;middle-dot dot-2&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://dhanifinanceandinsurance.in/page/Contact-Us&quot; id=&quot;iwsufi&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fas fa-arrow-right&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon End --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iscaul&quot; class=&quot;feature-large-images-wrapper bg-gray section-space--ptb_100&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-12&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- section-title-wrap Start --&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section-title-wrap text-center section-space--mb_10&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 id=&quot;i1x21a&quot; class=&quot;section-sub-title mb-20&quot;&gt;Get to Know About&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;ifow0m&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Flexible and Quick Business Loans For You&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- section-title-wrap Start --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-12&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images__two small-mt__10&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;modern-grid-image-box row row--30&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iep9xr&quot; class=&quot;single-item wow move-up col-lg-4 col-md-6 section-space--mt_60 small-mt__40 animated&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon Start --&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#&quot; class=&quot;ht-box-images style-02&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;image-box-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;box-image&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 id=&quot;i0jehf&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Very Low Rates on All Loans &lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon End --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i3iahl&quot; class=&quot;single-item wow move-up col-lg-4 col-md-6 section-space--mt_60 animated&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon Start --&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#&quot; class=&quot;ht-box-images style-02&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;image-box-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;box-image&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 id=&quot;iz3e1v&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;99.9% Success Rate Guarantee&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon End --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ivajks&quot; class=&quot;single-item wow move-up col-lg-4 col-md-6 section-space--mt_60 animated&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon Start --&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#&quot; class=&quot;ht-box-images style-02&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;image-box-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;box-image&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 id=&quot;iuzh18&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Flexible with Your Repayments&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon End --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-12&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-list-button-box mt-40 text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://dhanifinanceandinsurance.in/page/About-Us&quot; id=&quot;ik1vdz&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md&quot;&gt;Learn more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://dhanifinanceandinsurance.in/page/Contact-Us&quot; id=&quot;ihngo6&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md ht-btn--outline&quot;&gt;Contact us&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i8hgyj&quot;&gt;[AB-Gallery id=441]	&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!-- ============ Our Experience Wrapper Start =============== --&gt;&lt;!-- ============ Our Experience Wrapper End =============== --&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== Infotechno Video Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== Infotechno Video Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--===========  Projects wrapper Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  Projects wrapper End =============--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  Blog Section Start ====================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i447kf&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://digitalclics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Why-choose-us.gif&quot; width=&quot;950&quot; height=&quot;782&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ip6uzi&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;ilp8fc&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Our Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;ihlo7&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Why Choose Us?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iq3svj&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;There are many loan providing company available all around, but the issue is the documentation process and availability of loan service. In Dhani Finance , we focus on the root of the problem and try to remove the issue as far as possible. Now, apply for loan service if the documents are all ok with no objection than you could receive the loan in less than 5 working days.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 46, '1', '2024-05-04 06:35:01', '2024-05-07 05:02:09'),
(349, 522, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}#iu3f9i{width:100%;}#ih9iqz{color:black;font-size:20px;}@media (max-width: 480px){#iu3f9i{margin:200px 0px 0px 0px;}}', '&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper position-relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container service-slider__container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;img id=&quot;iu3f9i&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://enwpgo.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/aboutus-aboutme.jpg&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ivafzl&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://dhanifinanceservices.com/assets/images/resources/about-3-1.png&quot; height=&quot;709&quot; width=&quot;811&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ievnu9&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;izvani&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#086ad8&quot;&gt;About &lt;/font&gt;Dhani Finance and Insurance&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ih9iqz&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;We have tie up with 100+ finance partners to provide the best loans offers. Getting loans has just become easy with us, our loan process is very simple and it can be done in a few easy steps. We provide loans facility with various reputed banks and NBFCs in India such as ICICI Bank, HDFC, SBI, Axis, Citibank, PNB, American Express, Tata Capitals and others partners. Due to more bank options, you can easily compare all the loan offers and interest rates &amp;amp; choose wisely whichever suits you best. Our financial teams are professional and dedicated to find the best loan deals. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 46, '1', '2024-05-04 08:34:49', '2024-05-04 09:23:19');
