;&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#086ad8&quot;&gt;WELCOME  TO&lt;/font&gt; RAMASU HYDRAULICS PRIVATE LTD&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ixfwj&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;RAMASU HYDRAULICS PRIVATE LTD is the opposite of mainstream. From the beginning of the design phase, that we work with our clients to transform the product concept into a manufactural component, keeping in mind the concepts of Reliable, design-focused and efficient solutions. We stand for upmarket premium Impact Sockets. In order to meet all your expectations with certainty, RAMASU HYDRAULICS PRIVATE LTD adapts its tools to your specifications, even if they are very special. And because our clients are unique, we can customize tools in the colours of excellence. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ramasu.in/page/About-Us&quot; id=&quot;ifkrr&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md&quot;&gt;Read more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ipyjc&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap layout-section-bg section-space--pt_120 section-space--pb_120&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i8qoed&quot; class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iaumv&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;is56q&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;i3wad&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;itx9s&quot; class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot;&gt;WHY CHOOSE &lt;/span&gt;RAMASU HYDRAULICS PRIVATE LTD?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iscbv&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;RAMASU HYDRAULICS PRIVATE LTD develop the Reliable and efficient Impact Socke