 m-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-content text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 id=&quot;iren0a&quot; class=&quot;mb-15 text-white&quot;&gt;Divorce Problem\n                  &lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iy8h1j&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.cdnparenting.com/articles/2019/02/16184752/1034150995-H.webp&quot; height=&quot;709&quot; width=&quot;811&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;i9m11i&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ia5ibm&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;i5nqfq&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ip1eo2&quot; class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot;&gt;Divorce&lt;/span&gt; Problem\n                &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i7p2dy&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;\n                &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; id=&quot;ia4zxc&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text x15bjb6t x1n2onr6&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ila3wi&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text&quot;&gt;क्या आप भी अपने वैवाहिक जीवन से परेशान है? पति सही से बात नहीं करते? हमेशा परिवार में ग्रह कलेश बना रहता है? डायवोर्स स्थिति बनी हुई है?&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;वैवाहिक जीवन में समस्याओं का समाधान ढूंढना कठिन हो सकता है, लेकिन हमारे ज्योतिष उपाय विशेषांक आपको कुछ सार्थक सुझाव देते हैं जो वैवाहिक जीवन की समस्याओं को दूर करने में मदद कर सकते हैं। आप हमारे विशेष ज्योतिष से संपर्क करके अपनी समस्याओं का समाधान पा सकते हैं.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; id=&quot;ia5mlp&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text x15bjb6t x1n2onr6&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://panditjyo.webfire.in/page/Contact-Us&quot; id=&quot;iq4vrt&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md&quot;&gt;Contact Now&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ifha7&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iwrk&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper-2&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper position-relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container service-slider__container&quot;&gt;\n          &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ihxua&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ikhlt&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider-area section-space--pt_100&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-12&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section-title-wrap text-center section-space--mb_40&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 id=&quot;imwsz&quot; class=&quot;section-sub-title mb-20&quot;&gt;Our Happy Clients\n                      &lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container testimonial-slider__container swiper-container-initialized swiper-container-horizontal&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;innl9v&quot; class=&quot;swiper-wrapper testimonial-slider__wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-swiper-slide-index=&quot;3&quot; id=&quot;i03vgl&quot; class=&quot;swiper-slide swiper-slide-duplicate swiper-slide-prev&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iripaj&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__one wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider--info&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__media&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;assets/images/testimonial/mitech-testimonial-avata-01-90x90.webp&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__author&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-rating&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;author-info&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 class=&quot;name&quot;&gt;Abbie Ferguson\n                                    &lt;/h6&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;designation&quot;&gt;WEB DESIGNER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__text&quot;&gt;I’ve been working with over 35 IT companies on more than 200 projects of our company, but @Mitech is one of the most impressive to me.\n                              &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-swiper-slide-index=&quot;0&quot; id=&quot;ias6lk&quot; class=&quot;swiper-slide swiper-slide-active&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ifgxxz&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__one wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider--info&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__media&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://panditjyo.webfire.in/public/temp/49/1715681627.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;i2rni&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__author&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-rating&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;author-info&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 id=&quot;iupt7&quot; class=&quot;name&quot;&gt;Dr.Richa Pandey\n                                    &lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ijy8b&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__text&quot;&gt;Thank you so much guruji aapki wajah se mera divorce ruk gya or ab finnally hum sath bhi h sbb aapki wajah se guruji.\n                              &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-swiper-slide-index=&quot;1&quot; id=&quot;irh89o&quot; class=&quot;swiper-slide swiper-slide-next&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i6vgm3&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__one wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider--info&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__media&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://panditjyo.webfire.in/public/temp/49/17156816271.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ialrb&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__author&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-rating&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;author-info&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 id=&quot;i11zu&quot; class=&quot;name&quot;&gt;Smt. Soniya Devi\n                                    &lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ilt6e&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__text&quot;&gt;Hlo sir aapne Jo upay batae or aapne Jo kaam karaya hai usse m bahut khush hu.mere pati mujhse baat bhi karte h or jhagda bhi nhi karte hai.\n                              &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-swiper-slide-index=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;i2i5tm&quot; class=&quot;swiper-slide&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iqvmuq&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__one wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider--info&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__media&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://panditjyo.webfire.in/public/temp/49/17156816272.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ijnfn&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__author&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-rating&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;author-info&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 id=&quot;i6eq7&quot; class=&quot;name&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;if3509&quot; class=&quot;author_detail&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ibo9l7&quot; class=&quot;author_name&quot;&gt;Damini Saxena&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ih5jri&quot; class=&quot;publish_date&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iymwk6&quot; class=&quot;author_content&quot;&gt;\n                                      &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;im3ip&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__text&quot;&gt;Maine bhi work karaya h Jo bataya tha sahi he bataya or achha solution bhi diya hai.\n                              &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-pagination swiper-pagination-t01 section-space--mt_30 swiper-pagination-clickable swiper-pagination-bullets&quot;&gt;&lt;span tabindex=&quot;0&quot; role=&quot;button&quot; aria-label=&quot;Go to slide 1&quot; class=&quot;swiper-pagination-bullet swiper-pagination-bullet-active&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span tabindex=&quot;0&quot; role=&quot;button&quot; aria-label=&quot;Go to slide 2&quot; class=&quot;swiper-pagination-bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span tabindex=&quot;0&quot; role=&quot;button&quot; aria-label=&quot;Go to slide 3&quot; class=&quot;swiper-pagination-bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span tabindex=&quot;0&quot; role=&quot;button&quot; aria-label=&quot;Go to slide 4&quot; class=&quot;swiper-pagination-bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot; aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;swiper-notification&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--