;/h6&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iuwhv&quot; class=&quot;designation&quot;&gt;Doctor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ijy8b&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__text&quot;&gt;Thank you pandit jyotish, Sir aapki wajah se meri life me bahut change aaya hai or meri life ki problem dur hue. Mai apne carrier me aage badhi hu ,or success bhi mili hai. Thanks again&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-swiper-slide-index=&quot;1&quot; id=&quot;irh89o&quot; class=&quot;swiper-slide swiper-slide-next&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i6vgm3&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__one wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider--info&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__media&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://panditjyo.webfire.in/public/temp/49/1715678499.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ialrb&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__author&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-rating&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;author-info&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 id=&quot;i11zu&quot; class=&quot;name&quot;&gt;Soniya Saxena&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i51az&quot; class=&quot;designation&quot;&gt;Account&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ilt6e&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__text&quot;&gt;Dhanyawad guruji,  aapki wajah se meri family agree ho gyi h or mai bahut khush hu guruji , or Sonu ji mujhse pahle se jyada pyar karne lage h or khud apni family me baat ki or wo agree bhi ho gye h Finally dono ki family agree ho gyi h shadi ke liye.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-swiper-slide-index=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;i2i5tm&quot; class=&quot;swiper-slide&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iqvmuq&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__one wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider--info&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__media&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://panditjyo.webfire.in/public/temp/49/1715678490.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ijnfn&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__author&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-rating&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;author-info&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 id=&quot;i6eq7&quot; class=&quot;name&quot;&gt;Riya Srivastav&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;im3ip&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__text&quot;&gt;Maine bhi Pandit Jyotish ji se kaam karaya hai unhone Jo upay batae h unki wajah se meri problem dur hue h Nice satisfaction&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-pagination swiper-pagination-t01 section-space--mt_30 swiper-pagination-clickable swiper-pagination-bullets&quot;&gt;&lt;span tabindex=&quot;0&quot; role=&quot;button&quot; aria-label=&quot;Go to slide 1&quot; class=&quot;swiper-pagination-bullet swiper-pagination-bullet-active&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span tabindex=&quot;0&quot; role=&quot;button&quot; aria-label=&quot;Go to slide 2&quot; class=&quot;swiper-pagination-bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span tabindex=&quot;0&quot; role=&quot;button&quot; aria-label=&quot;Go to slide 3&quot; class=&quot;swiper-pagination-bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span tabindex=&quot;0&quot; role=&quot;button&quot; aria-label=&quot;Go to slide 4&quot; class=&quot;swiper-pagination-bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot; aria