yout-section-bg section-space--pt_120 section-space--pb_120&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;ixbh1s&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;OUR APPROACH&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i7shyc&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;We take a holistic approach to travel, considering every aspect of your journey to create a seamless and unforgettable experience. From the moment you start planning to the day you return home, we&#039;re here to support you every step of the way.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-left mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.veenaworld.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/Himachal-feature-image.jpg?imwidth=640&quot; width=&quot;726&quot; height=&quot;435&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;i0f1no&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iq0whg&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.india.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/HimachalPradesh-summer-vacation-1-1.jpg&quot; width=&quot;950&quot; height=&quot;782&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ixcens&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;imylod&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;OUR DESTINATIONS&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;if7dzf&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;We specialize in a variety of destinations around the India, from the pristine mountains of the Himachal to the rugged wilderness of Jim Corbett. Our team of travel experts have first-hand knowledge of these locations and can provide insider tips and recommendations to make your trip unforgettable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 52, '1', '2024-05-15 07:43:57', '2024-05-15 10:05:58'),
