uot;content&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 id=&quot;igcbvg&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Romantic Himachal Honeymoon Tour Package\n                      &lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;more-arrow-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://theholidayminister.com/page/Tour-Packages&quot; id=&quot;ip3jk9&quot;&gt;\n                          Learn more &lt;i class=&quot;fas fa-arrow-right&quot;&gt;\n                          &lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon End --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;imou8y&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;it86c2&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Hotels / Resort &amp;amp; Home Stay&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://r1imghtlak.mmtcdn.com/268fbbd41c4f11e88c710224510f5e5b.jpg?&amp;output-quality=75&amp;downsize=328:180&amp;crop=328:180;0,19&amp;output-format=jpg&quot; height=&quot;709&quot; width=&quot;811&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ipv7by&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ienhad&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;i48ppv&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Hotels &amp;amp; Homestays&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ie6vx1&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;For the cozy and comfortable stay, you can select the option of hotels and homestays from the luxury to budget friendly categories. You will feel the magic of this stay when you want to glorify the beauty of nature in solitude.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Homestays are within an amazingly friendly setup apart from the busy town. These quiet homes are like retreat centres where you can enjoy the fresh mountain breeze in a completely refreshing and chilling mood. It will perfectly suitable if you are will family, friends or as honeymooner couple.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap layout-section-bg section-space--pt_120 section-space--pb_120&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;idjue2&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Igloo Houses&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ied08c&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;Igloo Houses With your stay at tree houses and Igloo houses, you will get the chance to find the perfect blend with nature. Igloo houses and tree-houses add extra spark to your vacation with their thrilling touch. During an Igloo night stay, you can enjoy everything from skiing, snowboarding, meals, bonfire and barbeque within the backdrop of snow-mountains.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-left mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://static.toiimg.com/thumb/79871459/Igloo-Lodge.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=900&quot; width=&quot;726&quot; height=&quot;435&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ire1hm&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;isfoqz&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://res.cloudinary.com/liaison-inc/image/upload/f_auto/q_auto,w_1200/v1686332183/content/homeguide/homeguide-treehouse-with-balcony-in-home-backyard.jpg&quot; width=&quot;950&quot; height=&quot;782&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;i91zbx&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;i1gbsj&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Tree-Houses&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ievjf7&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;Similarly, tree-house stays offer an awe-inspiring 360 degree nature view with the complete comfort. These natural escapes are so stunning for honeymooners with an interior and warm hospitality. In this unmatched serenity and peace, you will find the wholesome just like once in lifetime experience!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;icd7ih&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;iegqd5&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iufd9d&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--====================  Accordion area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  Accordion area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  Accordion area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  Accordion area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--========== Call to Action Area Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--========== Call to Action Area End ============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 52, '1', '2024-05-15 09:18:32', '2024-05-18 03:41:24'),
