&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;collapse__13&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;heading__13&quot; data-bs-parent=&quot;#accordion_two&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our service offerings to enhance customer experience throughout the product lifecycle includes – test and repair, service management, and end-to-end warranty management. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i0eket&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- Start toggles --&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;toggles-wrapper section-space--pt_90&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;faq-two-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section-elements-title mb-30&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;faq-toggles-2&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;toggles_15&quot; class=&quot;card-header&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 class=&quot;mb-0&quot;&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;faq_15&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;toggles_15&quot; class=&quot;collapse show&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ikyijx&quot; class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;imsnyo&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i3bem&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;MQL Development&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;We use MetaTrader Software to make automated trading softwares and financial market indicators.&lt;br/&gt;Create a custom technical indicator.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span data-plain-text=&quot;*&quot; id=&quot;iuzng6&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text x1sdyfia x1ncwhqj xd4r4e8 x1n8ftqi&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ity1zu&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Get high quality leads with MQL.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span data-plain-text=&quot;*&quot; id=&quot;ivqzsg&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text x1sdyfia x1ncwhqj xd4r4e8 x1n8ftqi&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i1wiek&quot; class=&quot;selectable-text copyable-text&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Tweak an existing indicator.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span data-plain-text=&