ss=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i4f4ui&quot; class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot;&gt;Welcome to&lt;/span&gt; DS Earthing&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iftx6i&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;DS Earthing Private Limited is a leading manufacturer and provider of earthing solutions, offering a wide range of products and services to ensure safe and efficient electrical grounding. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;imbvb6&quot; class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;case-studies.html&quot; id=&quot;ib0xhs&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iw6gpf&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--============ Infotechno Hero Start ============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;infotechno-hero infotechno-bg&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--============ Infotechno Hero End ============--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!-- ============ Our Experience Wrapper Start =============== --&gt;&lt;!-- ============ Our Experience Wrapper End =============== --&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact-grid-4&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;imepom&quot; class=&quot;grid-item wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact--one text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 class=&quot;fun-fact__title&quot;&gt;Successfully work &lt;br/&gt; with &lt;/h5&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact__count counter&quot;&gt;1056&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fun-fact__text&quot;&gt;HAPPY CLIENTS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i51ku6&quot; class=&quot;grid-item wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact--one text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 class=&quot;fun-fact__title&quot;&gt;Successfully &lt;br/&gt; completed&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact__count counter&quot;&gt;491&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fun-fact__text&quot;&gt;Finished projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iqx6rj&quot; class=&quot;grid-item wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact--one text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 class=&quot;fun-fact__title&quot;&gt;Recruit more &lt;br/&gt; than&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact__count counter&quot;&gt;245&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fun-fact__text&quot;&gt;SKilled Experts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i1jbfg&quot; class=&quot;grid-item wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact--one text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 class=&quot;fun-fact__title&quot;&gt;Blog &lt;br/&gt; update &lt;/h5&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact__count counter&quot;&gt;1090&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fun-fact__text&quot;&gt;Media Posts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iz9zp4&quot;&gt;[Product-Gallery id=26]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== Infotechno Video Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== Infotechno Video Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--===========  Projects wrapper Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  Projects wrapper End =============--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  Blog Section Start ====================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i3uhbj&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/5c263c_51304d1d7d0340ce82648c51c1d12741~mv2.gif&quot; width=&quot;950&quot; height=&quot;782&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;i1grfe&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;i7610p&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#086ad8&quot; id=&quot;ixhasq&quot;&gt;ESE Lightning Arrester&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;itql68&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;An Electrical Systems Earth (ESE) Lightning Arrester, also known as an Early Streamer Emission Lightning Arrester, is a type of lightning protection device designed to mitigate the impact of lightning strikes on structures and equipment by providing a preferred path for lightning discharge to follow.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The primary purpose of an ESE lightning arrester is to intercept the lightning before it makes direct contact with the protected structure, such as a building or a tower. It operates based on the principle of creating a corona discharge at its tip when the electric field strength around it reaches a certain threshold. This corona discharge initiates an upward streamer earlier and more effectively than the surrounding objects, which then attracts the downward lightning leader coming from the thundercloud&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap layout-section-bg section-space--pt_80&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iybkp7&quot; class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i05g2f&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot; id=&quot;i0vm5l&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 class=&quot;heading&quot; id=&quot;if9zff&quot;&gt;Petrochemical &lt;/h5&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text mt-10&quot; id=&quot;ikz599&quot;&gt;Industrial static electricity is generated and accumulated during production, storage and transportation, and it has a great impact on safe production and product quality. Petrochemical production is characterized by high temperature and high pressure, flammable and explosive. Therefore, choosing a high-quality grounding solution is particularly important to protect the safety of facilities and personnel.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-left&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.cosmoeng.co.jp/img/service/top_technologies-02.gif&quot; width=&quot;724&quot; height=&quot;708&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;im9hic&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ilhj9k&quot;&gt;[AB-Gallery id=536]	&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i10bch&quot; class=&quot;feature-images__serven&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-4 col-md-6 wow move-up&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon Start --&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ht-box-images style-07&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;image-box-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;box-image&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;default-image&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://dsear.webfire.in/public/temp/54/1716368256.png&quot; width=&quot;68&quot; height=&quot;68&quot; alt=&quot;&quot;