nfobox_description&quot; data-elementor-inline-editing-toolbar=&quot;advanced&quot; class=&quot;uael-infobox-text elementor-inline-editing&quot;&gt;\n                                                                    If you stuck just contact us our experiences bike\n                                                                    mechanic will solve your query.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;img id=&quot;iu3f9i-2&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://mechanic.itechgurusolution.com/public/temp/55/17175713551.jpg&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;91e5220&quot; data-element_type=&quot;container&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-91e5220 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;010d873&quot; data-element_type=&quot;container&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-010d873 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;e-con-inner&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;37f4443&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;tp-unfold.default&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-37f4443 elementor-widget elementor-widget-tp-unfold&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;plus665215072fa8b&quot; data-content_a_source=&quot;content&quot; data-con_pos=&quot;default&quot; data-icon-position=&quot;tp_ic_pos_before&quot; data-readmore=&quot;Read More&quot; data-readless=&quot;Read Less&quot; data-readmore-icon=&quot;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&amp;quot;true&amp;quot; class=&amp;quot;e-font-icon-svg e-fas-caret-down&amp;quot; viewBox=&amp;quot;0 0 320 512&amp;quot; xmlns=&amp;quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&amp;quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&amp;quot;M31.3 192h257.3c17.8 0 26.7 21.5 14.1 34.1L174.1 354.8c-7.8 7.8-20.5 7.8-28.3 0L17.2 226.1C4.6 213.5 13.5 192 31.3 192z&amp;quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&quot; data-readless-icon=&quot;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&amp;quot;true&amp;quot; class=&amp;quot;e-font-icon-svg e-fas-caret-up&amp;quot; viewBox=&amp;quot;0 0 320 512&amp;quot; xmlns=&amp;quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&amp;quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&amp;quot;M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z&amp;quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&quot; data-transition-duration=&quot;200&quot; data-content-max-height=&quot;102&quot; data-content-max-height-t=&quot;100&quot; data-content-max-height-m=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;tp-unfold-wrapper plus665215072fa8b&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ipwiua&quot; class=&quot;tp-unfold-title&quot;&gt;Looking for Car and Bike Services ?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;irvd39&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;tp-fold-description&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i6bu74&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;tp-fold-description-inner&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;izsuxk&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You must be looking for &quot;Bike Mechanic Near Me&quot;, &quot; Bike Electrician Near Me&quot;\n      or &quot;Bike Service Near Me&quot; or &quot;EV Mechanic near me&quot;. Well, no more you would\n      want to search when you Install Bike Service app VMG Mobility. We bring the\n      experienced and best bike mechanics at your doorstep to provide you the Bike\n      Service or any Two Wheeler service at your doorstep within 20 minutes of\n      booking. \n    &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;irmehv&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Since electric bikes (EV Bikes) are the new trend and electric vehicles are\n      booming in India, manufacturers like Hero Electric, Hero Vida, Ather,\n      Okinawa, Ola Bike and many more are launching their electric bikes and\n      electric scooters in India. VMG Mobility covers it all be it Electric Bike\n      or Petrol Bike. We have expert Bike mechanics, Bike Electricians and EV\n      Technicians to meet the new demand.\n    &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;idu7pn&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt; \n    &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ih9vrh&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt; \n    &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iiywax&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt; \n    &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;tp-unfold-last-toggle flex-start&quot;&gt;&lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;tp-unfold-toggle&quot;&gt;Send&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 55, '1', '2024-05-28 08:23:07', '2024-06-17 06:02:50');
