(429, 623, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}#itk18{padding:0px 20px 0px 20px;color:black;font-size:15px;}#ioqb8{font-size:25px;color:#ea0303;}@media (max-width: 480px){#i6jn{margin:150px 0 0 0;}}', '&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-wrap banner-space about-us-bg&quot; id=&quot;i6jn&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-8 m-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-content text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;mb-15 text-white&quot; id=&quot;iwzf&quot;&gt;Term &amp;amp; Conditions&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;itk18&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;ioqb8&quot;&gt;Dear Teachers,&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;We hope this message finds you well. We are writing to inform you about the rules and regulations that govern our association with teachers at Impact Tutorial. Please take a moment to review the following guidelines:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;1. Teachers Registration Fees: To become a registered teacher with Impact Tutorial, a non-refundable registration fee of Rs. 500/- is required for a one-year membership, valid until 2024.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;2. Commission Deduction: For new tuition assignments, we will deduct only 50% of the first-month fees as commission. There will be no commission deduction from the second month onwards.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;3. Identification Requirements: It is mandatory for all teachers to possess a photo ID that provides proper address proof.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;4. Cancellation of Registration: Registration may be canceled without prior notification in the following instances:&lt;br/&gt;   A. Any misconduct towards the students, the institution, or any party associated with Impact Tutorial.&lt;br/&gt;   B. Absenteeism from tuition sessions without prior information.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;5. Amendment of Rules: Impact tutorial reserves the right to modify or introduce new rules as required. Any such changes will be communicated to you in a timely manner.&lt;/p&gt;', 65, '1', '2024-06-03 09:02:54', '2024-06-03 09:03:06');
