r-conditioning-and-cooling-systems-faces-refrigeration.jpg?ver=6&quot; width=&quot;950&quot; height=&quot;782&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;iwjncl&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;igtbwn&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Expertise and Experience:&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iykglh&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;With years of experience in the industry, our team of skilled technicians is well-equipped to handle repairs for various brands and models. We stay updated on the latest technological advancements in home appliances, enabling us to provide comprehensive solutions for both old and new devices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 67, '1', '2024-06-11 05:57:35', '2024-06-11 06:33:03'),
