(452, 644, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}#i5kfm6{color:black;margin:0px 10px 0px 10px;}#ixmqfi{margin:0px 10px 20px 10px;}#i96cb8{color:black;}#ibu6lk{margin:0 0 0 0px;}#iaz4ar{margin:0 0 0 0px;}@media (max-width: 480px){#i7syf{margin:150px 0 0 0;}}', '&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper position-relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container service-slider__container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-wrap banner-space about-us-bg&quot; id=&quot;i7syf&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-8 m-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-content text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;mb-15 text-white&quot; id=&quot;i1q2k&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot; id=&quot;im563i&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot; id=&quot;ixmqfi&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot; id=&quot;iv4pja&quot;&gt;ABOUT&lt;/span&gt; RAMASU HYDRAULICS PRIVATE LTD&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;i5kfm6&quot;&gt;RAMASU HYDRAULICS PRIVATE LTD is the opposite of mainstream. From the beginning of the design phase, that we work with our clients to transform the product concept into a manufactural component, keeping in mind the concepts of Reliable, design-focused and efficient solutions. We stand for upmarket premium Impact Sockets.&lt;br/&gt;In order to meet all your expectations with certainty, RAMASU HYDRAULICS PRIVATE LTD adapts its tools to your specifications, even if they are very special. And because our clients are unique, we can customize tools in the colours of excellence.&lt;br/&gt;RAMASU HYDRAULICS PRIVATE LTD develop the Reliable and efficient Impact Sockets and accessories that are best adapted to industries like Automobile, Railways, Heavy industries and many more like these. For people who know and express what they want. People who are inside the arena of engineering advancement. Who know the difference between tools and toys? Who believe in precise tooling. Are welcome to the arena! of RAMASU HYDRAULICS PRIVATE LTD.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap layout-section-bg section-space--pt_120 section-space--pb_120&quot; id=&quot;idklfg&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot; id=&quot;iaz4ar&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot; id=&quot;ix6m8z&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot;&gt;QUALITY &lt;/span&gt;ASSURANCE&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;ipxjze&quot;&gt;Good tools are a matter of trust. Trust is the basis of everything we do. We are well aware of that and so our work is guided by the following key success factors: High technological skills, excellence in all processes and absolute reliability when it comes to execution and service. That&#039;s what we stand for, that&#039;s how we want to inspire our customers. RAMASU stands for performance, competence and reliability - since 1988. For many decades RAMASU has been a first-tier supplier for the automotive industry. Because they trust in us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot; id=&quot;ig6u4k&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-left mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.pinimg.com/originals/19/97/f3/1997f3da28e8d29289097871f45b04fd.gif&quot; width=&quot;726&quot; height=&quot;435&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;iltfde&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot; id=&quot;i3ihy7&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot; id=&quot;ibu6lk&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/2190413/screenshots/15000924/media/253032da33210e73a554dfc6c6941cce.gif&quot; width=&quot;950&quot; height=&quot;782&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;iky8pa&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot; id=&quot;iqrq1j&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#086ad8&quot;&gt;Client&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;i96cb8&quot;&gt;Today, RAMASU is one of the leading manufacturers of tightening tools &quot;around the screw&quot;. Besides a wide range of standard Impact Sockets and accessories, we produce numerous special Impact Sockets, i.a. for Maruti Suzuki India Ltd., Suzuki Motorcycle India Ltd., Hyundai Motors India Ltd., Hero Honda Motors and we are the O.E supplier to Ingersoll Rand Wadco tools and many more. Without exaggeration we can say that our clients are well equipped with RAMASU products and solutions to their precise tooling needs&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 68, '1', '2024-06-14 10:18:34', '2024-06-14 10:32:14'),
