arments, games, employment, loan, insurance, and all other sectors of business. To prepare To reduce poverty level by providing employment opportunities. To make Bihar a developed state in the field of trade and the top state in the country. All types of products of Bihar reach the country and abroad.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i8a53j&quot; class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;tel:+918544244826&quot; id=&quot;iy71p2&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md&quot;&gt;CALL NOW!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-left mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://static.vecteezy.com/system/resources/previews/026/296/934/non_2x/tiny-woman-with-big-megaphone-in-smartphone-screen-advertising-agency-concept-service-advertisement-digital-marketing-smm-outdoor-advertising-modern-flat-cartoon-style-illustration-vector.jpg&quot; width=&quot;726&quot; height=&quot;435&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;iv47xl&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper-2&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;modern-it-company-top-area&quot;&gt;&lt;!--============ Modern It Company Hero Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--============ Modern It Company Hero End ============--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!-- ================  Clients Review Area Start ======================= --&gt;&lt;!-- ================  Clients Review Area End ======================= --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ibhyb2&quot; class=&quot;fun-fact-wrapper bg-gray section-space--pb_30 section-space--pt_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i3ndcq&quot; class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt