fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;il0a12&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;ipy8v3&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;iv97d2-2&quot; draggable=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;heading gjs-selected&quot;&gt;&lt;font id=&quot;iy68wr-2&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot; color=&quot;#086ad8&quot;&gt;Suraaj Group &lt;/font&gt;Founder&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;inoebi&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Name - Ganesh Suraaj&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Post - Business Trainer &amp;amp; Journalist&lt;br/&gt;Experience in operations Management &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i32106&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;Ganesh Suraaj is an experienced professional specializing in operations management, business training, and journalism. His multifaceted career has equipped him with a deep understanding of organizational dynamics, process optimization, and effective communication. As a business trainer, Ganesh has mentored numerous professionals, helping them to develop key skills and improve their operational efficiency. In his role as a journalist, he has covered various business topics, providing insightful analysis and reporting on industry trends.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i6ii5g&quot; class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/page/About-Us&quot; id=&quot;ieseex&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iz5t8j&quot; class=&quot;footer-preview section-space--ptb_120 prv-section-footer-bg&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ichusp&quot; class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iz7c14&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-12 col-md-12 m-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;footer-preview-content section-space--ptb_70 text-center&quot; id=&quot;i80xgf&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading text-white&quot;&gt;Take Steps to Get Closer &lt;br/&gt; To The Sweet Smell Of Success Now&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h6 class=&quot;heading text-white mt-25&quot;&gt;A High-growth Approach&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;header-button downlode-btn mt-40&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://suraajgroup.com/page/Contact-Us&quot; id=&quot;iq2l08&quot; class=&quot;btn btn--white&quot;&gt;INQUIRY NOW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 71, '1', '2024-06-15 06:46:13', '2024-06-16 07:51:35');
