nment.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;irmnwj&quot; class=&quot;text mt-10&quot;&gt;Sustainability Focus: We integrate sustainable practices into all our developments, ensuring a positive impact on the environment.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-left&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.pinimg.com/736x/38/47/36/3847365beb7da39d34684ae14e4b7bf5.jpg&quot; width=&quot;724&quot; height=&quot;708&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;i518ld&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i11rgq&quot;&gt;[AB-Gallery id=633]	&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ifaahnp&quot; class=&quot;contact-us-area appointment-contact-bg section-space--ptb_100&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-12&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contact-title section-space--mb_50&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-20&quot;&gt;Need a hand?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;itil4g&quot; class=&quot;sub-title&quot;&gt;Reach out to the world’s most reliable Properties.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i0uf2f&quot;&gt;[ab-form id=634]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contact-form-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- &lt;form class=&quot;contact-form&quot; id=&quot;contact-form-2&quot; action=&quot;https://whizthemes.com/mail-php/jowel/mitech/php/services-mail.php&quot; method=&quot;post&quot;&gt; --&gt;&lt;form method=&quot;post&quot; id=&quot;contact-form-2-2&quot; action=&quot;assets/php/services-mail.php&quot; novalidate=&quot;novalidate&quot; class=&quot;cont