tion ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iq7g2m&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/D4D12AQHT8V7NPKsSlg/article-inline_image-shrink_1000_1488/0/1711347121907?e=1723680000&amp;v=beta&amp;t=3Qf7MGKRmb9HSErqvu4sw73DGclCMD-r0n20uskemio&quot; height=&quot;709&quot; width=&quot;811&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;idmub&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;ibszwr&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ij6iwe&quot; class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot;&gt;About&lt;/span&gt; VEDProperties&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i8hlgz&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;At VED Properties, we believe in creating spaces that blend luxury, comfort, and sustainability. Our commitment to excellence and customer satisfaction has established us as a leading real estate company. Here&#039;s what sets us apart: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap layout-section-bg section-space--pt_120 section-space--pb_120&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iuy6hy&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;ih1s8d&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#086ad8&quot;&gt;Who We Are ?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iykqdw&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;Founded on principles of integrity and innovation, VED Properties has been a trusted name in the real estate industry for over a decade. Our team comprises seasoned professionals with extensive experience in property development, management, and investment. We pride ourselves on our ability to deliver high-quality residential, commercial, and mixed-use developments that meet the diverse needs of our clients.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-left mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://futureforward.nl/assets/Uploads/a6728160fc/Propcentral__ScaleMaxWidthWzE5MjBd.png&quot; width=&quot;726&quot; height=&quot;435&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ivvsi&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i6emki&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/D4D12AQGK8LbZRDa8kw/article-inline_image-shrink_1000_1488/0/1695745461335?e=1722470400&amp;v=beta&amp;t=z_5BlGr9azsXdZq_2F4UvotpqPLCbNgKyv9FXO3X79Q&quot; width=&quot;950&quot; height=&quot;782&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ifnz1&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;i693gw&quot; cla