;igdscl&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ikfj8c&quot; class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot;&gt;Blazon Brite Real State: &lt;/span&gt; Redefining Real Estate Excellence\n                &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ixzwlp&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;At Blazon Brite Real State, we believe in creating spaces that blend luxury, comfort, and sustainability. Our commitment to excellence and customer satisfaction has established us as a leading real estate company. Here&#039;s what sets us apart: \n                &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i4ys9m&quot; class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://vedproperties.in/page/About-Us&quot; id=&quot;iss2sv&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ifz1x5&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap layout-section-bg section-space--pt_80&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i3xzcy&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i6yxfw&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ht-box-icon preview-style&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;icon-box-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ipsuzb&quot; class=&quot;text mt-10&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i3k9iu&quot;&gt;Blazon Brite Real State\n                        &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iqkfzl&quot; class=&quot;text mt-10&quot;&gt;Quality: Our commitment to quality ensures that every project we undertake is completed to the highest standards.\n                      &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i3n075&quot; class=&quot;text mt-10&quot;&gt;Customer-Centric Approach: We prioritize our clients&#039; needs and work closely with them to ensure their satisfaction.\n                      &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iolwso&quot; class=&quot;text mt-10&quot;&gt;Sustainability Focus: We integrate sustainable practices into all our developments, ensuring a positive impact on the environment.\n                      &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;irmnwj&quot; class=&quot;text mt-10&quot;&gt;Sustainability Focus: We integrate sustainable practices into all our developments, ensuring a positive impact on the environment.\n                      &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-left&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.freepik.com/free-photo/modern-residential-district-with-green-roof-balcony-generated-by-ai_188544-10276.jpg?size=626&amp;ext=jpg&amp;ga=GA1.1.1141335507.1717891200&amp;semt=ais_user&quot; width=&quot;724&quot; height=&quot;708&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;i518ld&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;in00nw&quot;&gt;[AB-Gallery id=642]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 64, '1', '2024-06-25 06:07:57', '2024-06-25 06:34:09');
