Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot; id=&quot;iq7awf&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;ieveyg&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Introduction&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;At My CSC Shop, we value your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you use our services at our CSC Center located at RAMNAGAR ROD KANKANE VATIKA KE PASS, Chirgaon, Jhansi, UP 284301.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Contact Information&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or your personal data, please contact us at:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- **Shop Name**: My CSC Shop&lt;br/&gt;- **Work**: CSC Center&lt;br/&gt;- **Address**: RAMNAGAR ROD KANKANE VATIKA KE PASS, Chirgaon, Jhansi, UP 284301&lt;br/&gt;- **Contact Number**: 6388413200&lt;br/&gt;- **Email**: financialonline.s.owner.ndsm@gmail.com&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Information We Collect&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;We may collect the following types of information:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. **Personal Information**:&lt;/b&gt; Name, email address, phone number, and other contact details.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. **Financial Information**:&lt;/b&gt; Payment details, billing address, and transaction history.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. **Technical Information**:&lt;/b&gt; IP address, browser type, and usage data.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. **Other Information**:&lt;/b&gt; Any other information you provide to us voluntarily.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;How We Use Your Information&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;We use the collected information for the following purposes:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. **To Provide Services**: &lt;/b&gt;To process transactions, manage your account, and provide customer support.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. **To Improve Our Services**:&lt;/b&gt; To understand how you use our services and to improve them.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. **To Communicate with You**: &lt;/b&gt;To send you updates, promotions, and other relevant information.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. **To Comply with Legal Obligations**:&lt;/b&gt; To comply with applicable laws and regulations.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt; How We Share Your Information&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties. However, we may share your information with:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. **Service Providers**:&lt;/b&gt; Third-party service providers who perform services on our behalf.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. **Legal Authorities**:&lt;/b&gt; If required by law or to protect our rights.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt; How We Protect Your Information&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;We implement appropriate security measures to protect your personal data from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Rights&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;You have the right to:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. **Access Your Data**:&lt;/b&gt; Request a copy of the personal data we hold about you.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. **Correct Your Data**:&lt;/b&gt; Request correction of any inaccurate or incomplete data.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. **Delete Your Data**:&lt;/b&gt; Request deletion of your personal data, subject to certain legal obligations.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. **Object to Processing**:&lt;/b&gt; Object to the processing of your personal data in certain circumstances.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Changes to This Privacy Policy&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on our website.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Contact Us&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us at:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phone**:&lt;/b&gt; 6388413200&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Email**:&lt;/b&gt; financialonline.s.owner.ndsm@gmail.com&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;By using our services, you consent to the terms of this Privacy Policy. Thank you for trusting My CSC Shop with your personal data.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 37, '1', '2024-06-24 08:10:58', '2024-06-24 08:11:10'),
