tion and for all activities that occur under your account.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt; 4. Payment and Fees&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Service Fees**:&lt;/b&gt; Fees for our services will be as per the rates displayed at the center or communicated to you directly.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Payment Methods**:&lt;/b&gt; We accept payments through various modes including cash, card, and digital payments. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt; 5. Privacy Policy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Your use of our services is also governed by our Privacy Policy, which can be found [here](#). Please review our Privacy Policy for details on how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt; 6. Limitation of Liability&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;My CSC Shop shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of or related to your use of our services.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt; 7. Changes to Terms&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Any changes will be posted on our website and will become effective upon posting.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;8. Governing Law&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;These terms and conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India. Any disputes arising out of or related to these terms will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in Jhansi, Uttar Pradesh.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt; 9. Contact Us&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;If you have any questions about these Terms and Conditions, please contact us at:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Phone**&lt;/b&gt;: 6388413200&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Email**&lt;/b&gt;: financialonline.s.owner.ndsm@gmail.com&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;---&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;By using our services, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions.**&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 37, '1', '2024-06-24 08:12:57', '2024-06-24 08:21:38'),
(493, 696, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}#iqcmr1{font-size:18px;color:black;}@media (max-width: 480px){#i802pg{margin:100px 0 0 0;}}', '&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper position-relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container service-slider__container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-wrap banner-space about-us-bg&quot; id=&quot;i802pg&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-8 m-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-content text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;mb-15 text-white&quot; id=&quot;is4zpf&quot;&gt;Refund Policy&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot; id=&quot;ieehuw&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot; id=&quot;imwbkg&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;iqcmr1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt; Refund Policy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt; My CSC Shop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt; Contact Information&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- **&lt;b&gt;Shop Name**:&lt;/b&gt; My CSC Shop&lt;br/&gt;- **&lt;b&gt;Work**:&lt;/b&gt; CSC Center&lt;br/&gt;- **Address**: Ramnagar Road, Kankane Vatika Ke Pass, Chirgaon, Jhansi, UP 284301&lt;br/&gt;- **&lt;b&gt;Contact Number**:&lt;/b&gt; 6388413200&lt;br/&gt;- **&lt;b&gt;Email**:&lt;/b&gt; financialonline.s.owner.ndsm@gmail.com&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt; Refund Policy Details&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt; 1. **Eligibility for Refunds**&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;We aim to ensure customer satisfaction with every purchase. Refunds are available under the following conditions:&lt;br/&gt;- The item must be returned within 30 days of the purchase date.&lt;br/&gt;- The item must be unused, in its original packaging, and in the same condition as when it was received.&lt;br/&gt;- Proof of purchase (receipt or order number) is required for all refund requests.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt; 2. **Non-Refundable Items**&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Certain items are non-refundable, including but not limited to:&lt;br/&gt;- Perishable goods such as food, flowers, newspapers, or magazines.&lt;br/&gt;- Intimate or sanitary goods.&lt;br/&gt;- Hazardous materials or flammable liquids and gases.&lt;br/&gt;- Downloadable software products.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt; 3. **Process for Requesting a Refund**&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;To initiate a refund, please follow these steps:&lt;br/&gt;1. Contact us at 6388413200 or email us at financialonline.s.owner.ndsm@gmail.com with your order number and reason for the return.&lt;br/&gt;2. Our customer service team will review your request and provide you with a return authorization and instructions on how to send back the item.&lt;br/&gt;3. Once your return is received and inspected, we will notify you of the approval or rejection of your refund.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt; 4. **Refunds (if applicable)**&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Approved Refunds**:&lt;/b&gt; Once approved, your refund will be processed, and a credit will be automatically applied to your original method of payment within a certain number of days, depending on your card issuer&#039;s policies.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Late or Missing Refunds**:&lt;/b&gt; If you haven’t received a refund yet, first check your bank account again. Then contact your credit card company, as it may take some time before your refund is officially posted. If you’ve done all of this and still have not received your refund, please contact us at financialonline.s.owner.ndsm@gmail.com.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt; 5. **Shipping Costs**&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- Shipping costs are non-refundable. If you receive a refund, the cost of return shipping will be deducted from your refund.&lt;br/&gt;- Depending on your location, the time it may take for your exchanged product to reach you may vary.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;6. **Exchanges**&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;We only replace items if they are defective or damaged. If you need to exchange it for the same item, contact us at 6388413200 or email us at financialonline.s.owner.ndsm@gmail.com for further instructions.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;7. **Contact Us**&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;For any questions or concerns regarding our refund policy, please reach out to us:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phone**:&lt;/b&gt; 6388413200&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Email**:&lt;/b&gt; financialonline.s.owner.ndsm@gmail.com&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;We appreciate your business and strive to provide the best customer service possible. Thank you for shopping at My CSC Shop.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 37, '1', '2024-06-24 08:22:57', '2024-06-24 08:27:14'),
