Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iqyd9&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://merakikhang.in/public/temp/77/17195814192.jpeg&quot; height=&quot;709&quot; width=&quot;811&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ikkkw&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;i0zng&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;isucm&quot; class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot;&gt;About&lt;/span&gt; Hotel Meraki Khang&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i9gt3&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;Hotel Meraki Khang, your serene retreat nestled in the heart of Manali, where breathtaking natural beauty meets unparalleled hospitality. Perched amidst the majestic Himalayas, our hotel offers an idyllic escape with panoramic views that captivate the soul. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ipqv6&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap layout-section-bg section-space--pt_120 section-space--pb_120&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ikdil&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;i5khx&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Our Story&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iy9iu&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;Hotel Meraki Khang is not just a place to stay, but a destination where every detail is infused with care and passion. &quot;Meraki&quot; is a Greek word that means to do something with love, creativity, and soul, and &quot;Khang&quot; is a traditional Himalayan term for home. Together, they represent our commitment to providing a warm and inviting atmosphere that feels like home, filled with love and personalized service.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-left mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://merakikhang.in/public/temp/77/17194802836.jpeg&quot; width=&quot;726&quot; height=&quot;435&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ilne5&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ibcua&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ib0ae&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://merakikhang.in/public/temp/77/1719581419.jpeg&quot; width=&quot;950&quot; height=&quot;782&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;iy0xw&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;ijvaw&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Stunning Views&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i1cas&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;One of the most striking features of Hotel Meraki Khang is its stunning location. Our guests wake up to the sight of sun-kissed peaks, lush green valleys, and the tranquil Beas River flowing gracefully through the landscape. Each room is designed to maximize these awe-inspiring views, ensuring that nature’s beauty is always within sight.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ikegrk&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap layout-section-bg section-space--pt_120 section-space--pb_120&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iwr0l4&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;i9fh0z&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Luxurious Accommodations&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i710mz&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Our well-appointed rooms and suites are designed with a\nblend of contemporary elegance and traditional charm. Every room features large\nwindows, plush bedding, modern amenities, and a private balcony to immerse\nyourself in the surrounding vistas. Whether you are here for a romantic\ngetaway, a family vacation, or a solo adventure, our accommodations cater to\nall your needs.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-left mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://merakikhang.in/public/temp/77/1719480118.JPG&quot; width=&quot;726&quot; height=&quot;435&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ijwx0h&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i5umng&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;il4axp&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://merakikhang.in/public/temp/77/17194802832.jpeg&quot; width=&quot;950&quot; height=&quot;782&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;il191&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;i41t35&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Exquisite Dining&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iz9fu8&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;Indulge in a culinary journey at our in-house restaurant, where our chefs craft delectable dishes using locally sourced ingredients. From traditional Himachali cuisine to international favorites, our menu is designed to tantalize your taste buds while you enjoy the picturesque views from our dining area.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 77, '1', '2024-06-27 10:40:36', '2024-07-09 10:22:16'),
(502, 700, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}@media (max-width: 480px){#ige6{margin:100px 0 0 0;}}', '&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ige6&quot; class=&quot;about-banner-wrap banner-space about-us-bg&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-8 m-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-content text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 id=&quot;iu87&quot; class=&quot;mb-15 text-white&quot;&gt;Gallery&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ikg65&quot;&gt;[AB-Gallery id=651]&lt;/div&gt;', 77, '1', '2024-06-27 10:41:53', '2024-07-09 10:22:27'),
(503, 703, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}#ix2sq{font-size:18px;color:black;}', '&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-wrap banner-space about-us-bg&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-8 m-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-content text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;mb-15 text-white&quot; id=&quot;iyyi&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-large-images-wrapper section-space--ptb_100&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-12&quot; id=&quot;i5opz&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- section-title-wrap Start --&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text&quot; id=&quot;ix2sq&quot;&gt;We give much importance to privacy because your privacy is always very important to us. Being a common process our website involves in the collection and use of information about you.According to law we are required to ask you for certain information in order to continue our services for you, but we are strongly committed to protect your personal and financial information.Our privacy policy explains what type of information we collect and what we do with that information to allow you to make choices about the way your information is collected and used.&lt;br/&gt;What Information Do We Collect&lt;br/&gt;The following privacy states that how we use this information and protects it when our website is used by you or anyone. We are committed to ensure that your privacy is protected and safe.We ask you to provide certain information by which we can identify you while using this website, then you are assured that it will only be used in accordance with this privacy statement.This privacy policy can be revised and updated according to time. Information that we collect&lt;br/&gt;Name address,contact information ,cellphone,email,reason to contact us.&lt;br/&gt;What we do with information collected&lt;br/&gt;By the collected information we try to understand that what are your requirements and needs by us in order to provide you better results.We may use your information to improve our services in order to make you fully satisfied.We can use it to contact you to inform about newly launched services etc.This is all keeping in mind that use of your information is only for your benefit.We can contact you by means of Cell phone,email etc. Security&lt;br/&gt;We are committed to provide our online users with services and information in an efficient and secure manner. We are Strongly committed and dedicated for the safety of your information collected by us.We take different safety measures to protect and safeguard your information so that it may not be misused or leaked by any means.&lt;br/&gt;Cookie usage&lt;br/&gt;Cookie is a temporary small internet file which ask for permission to be copied on your computer&#039;s hard disk if you agree in yes.This file is used to analyze web traffic,site visit time,history,etc.It gives you as a single identity.It is your will or depends on you whether you accept or decline cookies to be copied on your computer by changing your browsers setting.By using cookie you can get the full information on our website which can be beneficial for you.&lt;br/&gt;Other website links&lt;br/&gt;The above privacy policy applies only to  http://servicerepaircenters.co.in/​ It may contain links which are not regulated and controlled by us.We do not accept any responsibility or liability for the sites linked with us.You may contact directly those linked websites if you feel any issue about their privacy policy&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section-title-wrap text-center section-space--mb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- section-title-wrap Start --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 67, '1', '2024-06-27 13:05:53', '2024-06-27 13:05:53'),
