;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot; id=&quot;ivkjnd&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.tourradar.com/days-to-come/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/GroupTour2-min.jpg&quot; height=&quot;709&quot; width=&quot;811&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;itc9hv&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;imegwh&quot;&gt;With warm regards, we take this as an opportunity to introduce ourselves as the leading Group Tour organizer of M.P. &amp;amp; CHHATTISGARH having head office at Raipur. We have been successfully organizing various Corporate, School and College group tours.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We have a solid experience of past 14 years in the tourism industry &amp;amp; have full known how &amp;amp; expertise of conducting Group Tour Packages which make us more efficient, reliable &amp;amp; top in the field.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our tour itineraries are planned, after a great deal of travel research to ensure maximum travel comfort &amp;amp; minimum travel fatigue. Further our tour packages are educational, economical, comfortable &amp;amp; pleasurable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap layout-section-bg section-space--pt_120 section-space--pb_120&quot; id=&quot;ie9mmw&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot; id=&quot;iq6xga&quot;&gt;USPs of Choice Holidays&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;imvbt9&quot;&gt;• Professional Tour Manager Service during the tour.&lt;br&gt;• Mineral Water during sightseeing and meals.\n                &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper-2&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;modern-it-company-top-area&quot;&gt;&lt;!--============ Modern It Company Hero Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--============ Modern It Company Hero End ============--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&l