(551, 753, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}#io9c{background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:left top;background-attachment:scroll;background-size:cover;background-image:url(&#039;https://goldeneratoursandtravels.com/public/temp/79/1719995331.jpg&#039;);}#is0nv8t{text-align:center;margin:0px 0px 20px 0px;}#i77y4oi{font-size:25px;padding:0 0 0 25px;}#i3vi0wv{color:#000000;}#i09fje{padding:0px 10px 0px 10px;font-size:25px;color:#ffa234;}#ijucvi{padding:0px 10px 0px 10px;color:black;font-size:20px;}#izbiwq{padding:0px 10px 0px 10px;font-size:18px;color:black;}#iwi7jd{white-space-collapse:preserve;}#iaatqi{white-space-collapse:preserve;}#iehj0u{white-space-collapse:preserve;}#iz86g3{white-space-collapse:preserve;}#i9apya{white-space-collapse:preserve;}#ig12qq{white-space-collapse:preserve;}#i5u9wz{white-space-collapse:preserve;}@media (max-width: 480px){#io9c{margin:130px 0px 0px 0px;}}', '&lt;div id=&quot;ia9g&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iqe2&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i6je&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i4iy&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i2r3&quot; class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ipsxeq&quot;&gt;[navbar id=72 ]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;io9c&quot; class=&quot;about-banner-wrap banner-space about-us-bg&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-8 m-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-content text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 id=&quot;irkz&quot; class=&quot;mb-15 text-white&quot;&gt;Bali Island &lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i09fje&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i5whf&quot;&gt;Bali - Island of God\n            &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ijucvi&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i6tu5&quot;&gt;Package Duration - 4 Days / 3 Nights&lt;br/&gt;Bali - Island of God&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;izbiwq&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Detailed Itinerary\n              &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;DAY 1 : BENOA HARBOR TO JOIN SUN SET DINNER CRUISE WITH BOUNTY CRUISE( D)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Morning 06 :35 arrival at bali airport &amp;amp; catch the connecting flight for Bali . Arrive at NGURAH RAI INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT and proceed to immigration for get stamp passport. Collecting luggage and meet our guide at the arrival zone meeting point. Get Flower Garland from our Balinese Costumed Girl before proceed to hotel for check in At 4.00PM ready to have Afternoon Tours to Transfer to Benoa harbor to join Sun Set Dinner Cruise with BOUNTY CRUISE ,Come aboard the Bounty dinner cruise for a night of floating fun. Be entertained by traditional Balinese dance. Modern dance, live music, trio Batakos singers. Variety review and dance the night away with its onboard DJ.Enjoy INDIAN FOOD dinner Boarding at 5.30pm, Bounty cruise dinner operates 5.45pm until 8.45pm. (D).&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;DAY 2 : RIVER RAFTING WITH MEGA RAFTING + UBUD VILLAGE TOUR&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The Longest RAFTING Trip on Ayung River (Approximately 10 km of wild river).Join our professional team for superb Whitewater Rafting Adventure on Ayung River. Experience a unique and unforgettable journey through winding gorges, luscious jungles, and magnificent terraced rice fields, Paddle though breathtaking waterfalls for unparalleled fun on the river.Transfer from hotel and drive you through Bali’s unspoiled villages in the Carang Sari district. Welcome drink upon arrival. After a brief instruction on paddling and river safety, you are off to the longest and best rafting trip on the Ayung River. Transfer to UBUD / Explore Ubud Village for shopping in Ubud Market + shopping around the street in Ubud Village.(It will take approx 1 hour 15 minutes drive to get to UBUD Village).Transfer back to hotel for a short rest &amp;amp; shower to be ready for having dinner outside of the hotel.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;DAY 3 : BALI SAFARI &amp;amp; MARINE PARK&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Breakfast at hotel. Pick up from hotel and transfer to BALI SAFARI &amp;amp; MARINE PARK, in Gianyar Regency. ** DRAGON PACKAGE : Animal education show, Bali Agung performance at Silver seat *), Elephant Educational show *), Fresh water aquarium, fun Zone *), Safari journey trip, Water park. Afternoon time will be transferred back to hotel, rest and relax and shower to be ready for dinner by own outside of the hotel.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;DAY 4 : WATERSPORT ACTIVITIES + ULUWATU TEMPLE TOUR + KECAK DANCNE&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Breakfast at hotel. Morning transfer to TANJUNG BENOA BEACH for WATERSPORT ACTIVITIES. Package Including :&lt;br/&gt;* 1 x Banana Boat Ride&lt;br/&gt;* 1 x Visit to Turtle Island with Glass Bottom Boat Optional water Sports can be taken on the spot on personal account, such as parasailing, jet ski, flying fish, snorkeling, sky tube, sea walker, etc. Afterwards, continue to ULUWATU TEMPLE. Uluwatu Temple, or Pura Luhur Uluwatu, one of six key temples believed to be Bali&#039;s spiritual pillars, is renowned for its magnificent location, perched on top of a steep cliff approximately 70 metres above sea level. It is an ancient temple of ULUWATU, located on top of the cliff jutting out to the sea, hundreds of meters above the Indian ocean. At 6.15pm to see an evening performance of KECAK is Bali’s most dramatic dance performance popularly known as monkey dance, enacted by a group of over 100 men, dance is concentric circle. The story is taken from ancient Hindu epic, the Ramayana. It starts at 18.00pm for one hour duration.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;DAY 5&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Check out form the hotel after b/fast &amp;amp; transfer to airport to catch the flight for India .&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i77y4oi&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i3vi0wv&quot;&gt;Domestic Tour\n            &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper-5&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ieyfkf&quot; class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--============ Software Innovation Hero Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--============ Software Innovation Hero End ============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  Projects wrapper Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  Projects wrapper End =============--&gt;&lt;!--=========== About Company Area Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== About Company Area End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-icon-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-icon-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--===========  Projects wrapper Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  Projects wrapper End =============--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;is0nv8t&quot; class=&quot;button-group-wrap mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://goldeneratoursandtravels.com/page/Thailand&quot; id=&quot;ikgvtxe&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md ht-btn--outline&quot;&gt;Thailand&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://goldeneratoursandtravels.com/page/Singapore&quot; id=&quot;iedor7&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md ht-btn--outline&quot;&gt;Singapore with cruise Sizzling Singapore&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&