(552, 755, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}#io9c{background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:left top;background-attachment:scroll;background-size:cover;background-image:url(&#039;https://goldeneratoursandtravels.com/public/temp/79/1719995331.jpg&#039;);}#is0nv8t{text-align:center;margin:0px 0px 20px 0px;}#i77y4oi{font-size:25px;padding:0 0 0 25px;}#i3vi0wv{color:#000000;}#i09fje{padding:0px 10px 0px 10px;font-size:25px;color:#ffa234;}#ijucvi{padding:0px 10px 0px 10px;color:black;font-size:20px;}#izbiwq{padding:0px 10px 0px 10px;font-size:18px;color:black;}#iwk9ej{white-space-collapse:preserve;}#inltum{white-space-collapse:preserve;}#i9rcrg{white-space-collapse:preserve;}#iavpv4{white-space-collapse:preserve;}#iig8kh{white-space-collapse:preserve;}#ioldgg{white-space-collapse:preserve;}#icysfh{white-space-collapse:preserve;}@media (max-width: 480px){#io9c{margin:130px 0px 0px 0px;}}', '&lt;div id=&quot;ivpg&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iqe2&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i6je&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i4iy&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i2r3&quot; class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ipsxeq&quot;&gt;[navbar id=72 ]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;io9c&quot; class=&quot;about-banner-wrap banner-space about-us-bg&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-8 m-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-content text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 id=&quot;irkz&quot; class=&quot;mb-15 text-white&quot;&gt;Malaysia&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i09fje&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i5whf&quot;&gt;Malaysia - Truly Asia\n            &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ijucvi&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i6tu5&quot;&gt;Package Duration - 4 Days / 3 Nights&lt;br/&gt;Malaysia - Truly Asia&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;izbiwq&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Detailed Itinerary\n              &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;DAY 1: INDIA - KUALA LUMPUR - GENTING HIGHLANDS&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Arrive into Kuala Lumpur. On arrival, you will be met &amp;amp; transferred to Genting Highlands, the most exciting hill resort, only 50 kms from Kuala Lumpur. Arrive and transfer to your hotel. Boating on the lake, fun rides on bumper cars and roller coasters are just a few of its attractions. Evening free to enjoy the nightlife and international Dinner shows or try your luck at the world-class casino. Overnight will be in the hotel.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;DAY 2: GENTING - KUALA LUMPUR&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Breakfast at the hotel and transfer to Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia largest city and the country &amp;amp; Mosque political capital . Enroute brief stop at Batu Caves.The city is a blend of different cultures and styles &amp;amp; distinctly a multiracial cosmopolitan city. Arrive and transfer to the hotel. Overnight will be the hotel.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;DAY 3: KUALA LUMPUR CITY TOUR + KL TOWER&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;After breakfast, enjoy a half-day city tour. Visit Masjid Jamek (Jamek Mosque), which is the oldest mosque in Kuala Lumpur. Another must see is the Tugu Negara or War Memorial where we honor those who perished in the war which is inside Lake Garden. After that proceed for the KL Tower enjoy a panoramic view from there. Go to chinatown located on Petaling Street is full of good bargains and deals, food of sorts and rich Chinese culture. See the Thien Hou Temple. You will also pass the Moorish-styled Federal Court, the Railway station which is a striking piece of Mohammedan architecture, the Tudor styled Cricket Club and the Kings Palace. The last stop will be at the Handicraft center where you can find fine and splendid OE Jewelry making demonstrations. Accommodation at hotel Rest of the day free for shopping. Overnight will be in the hotel.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;DAY 4: KUALA LUMPUR – INDIA&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;After breakfast proceed to the airport to board your a flight back to home. Breakfast. Transfer to the airport. Depart.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i77y4oi&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i3vi0wv&quot;&gt;Domestic Tour\n            &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper-5&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ieyfkf&quot; class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--============ Software Innovation Hero Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--============ Software Innovation Hero End ============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  Projects wrapper Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  Projects wrapper End =============--&gt;&lt;!--=========== About Company Area Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== About Company Area End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-icon-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-icon-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--===========  Projects wrapper Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  Projects wrapper End =============--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;is0nv8t&quot; class=&quot;button-group-wrap mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://golde