ction-space--pt_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;io1nj7&quot; class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iljlzu&quot; class=&quot;col-md-3 col-sm-6 wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact--two text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact__count counter&quot;&gt;120&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h6 class=&quot;fun-fact__text&quot;&gt;Happy clients&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ixocl4&quot; class=&quot;col-md-3 col-sm-6 wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact--two text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact__count counter&quot;&gt;32&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h6 class=&quot;fun-fact__text&quot;&gt;Finished projects&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iug4w7&quot; class=&quot;col-md-3 col-sm-6 wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact--two text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact__count counter&quot;&gt;73&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h6 class=&quot;fun-fact__text&quot;&gt;Skilled Experts&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i83i18&quot; class=&quot;col-md-3 col-sm-6 wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact--two text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact__count counter&quot;&gt;318&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h6 class=&quot;fun-fact__text&quot;&gt;Media Posts&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i12hpw&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;About Good Luck Properties&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;At Shubhakana, our passion is to create spaces that are at par with global standards, epitomize our family values, and are built on a legacy of trust spanning four decades. We are guided by our vision of “Building Better Lives”. Good Luck Properties enables and transforms you to become a better version of yourself by maximizing your potential and living a rich life.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Be within your reach.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i6eyi&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;Chhattisgarh is a state of India, located in the central part of the country. It was formed on 1 November 2000 and is the 26th state of India. Earlier it was under Madhya Pradesh. It is said that at one time there were 36 forts in this area, that is why it was named Chhattisgarh. But even though the number of forts increased, there was no change in the name. Chhattisgarh is such a state of India which has been given the status of &#039;Mahatari&#039; (Mother). There are two areas in India whose name changed due to special reasons - one is &#039;Magadha&#039; which due to abundance of Buddhist monasteries is known as &quot;Bihar&quot;. And the second &#039;Dakshin Kaushal&#039; which became &quot;Chhattisgarh&quot; due to keeping thirty six forts within itself. But both these regions have been making India proud since ancient times. &quot;Chhattisgarh&quot; has been the center of development of various cultures since the Vedic and mythological times. The ancient temples here and their ruins indicate that various Vaishnava, Shaiva, Shakta and Buddhist cultures existed here. There has been influence in blacks. A resource-rich state, it is a source of power and steel for the country, producing 15% of total steel. Chhattisgarh is one of the fastest growing states in India.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Having been ranked as the “Most Liveable City in India” several times – Raipur is the cultural and educational capital of Chhattisgarh. It is one of the most important educational and industrial centers of India. Called &quot;Lord Ram Nanihal, it is blessed with top schools and colleges of the country. It is home to world&#039;s top manufacturers - Steel, Iron. It has seen overall development in social infrastructure and livelihood - Good Weather, Chhattisgarh Of Due to good connectivity to parts, a young metropolitan population and influx of large MNCs and corporates. This has resulted in rapid growth in real estate in Raipur – making it an ideal investment destination.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Let&#039;s take a look at the reasons that make buying property in Raipur a good option for home buyers:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Vitality Quotient -&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Undisputedly Chhattisgarh&#039;s No. 1 city on Liveability Index*, Raipur Metropolitan Region is home to Mahadev Ghat - giving it &#039;always pleasant&#039; weather throughout the year and the entire city is filled with beauty and elegance. The lush green landscape throughout the city ensures an unlimited supply of fresh and clean air and again clean water. eing one of the youngest metropolitan cities of Chhattisgarh, it is home to many historical monuments like Martyr Memorial, Science Centre, Swami Vivekananda Sarovar Budha Talab, Kaushilya Mata Temple Chandkhuri, Purkhauti Mugtangan, Jungle Safari – which makes it a desirable travel destination. Is.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 85, '1', '2024-07-13 06:53:35', '2024-07-14 07:31:03'),
