INSERT INTO `ab_page_content` (`id`, `page_id`, `cssdata`, `content`, `admin_id`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(572, 774, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}#io9c{background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:left top;background-attachment:scroll;background-size:cover;background-image:url(&#039;https://goldeneratoursandtravels.com/public/temp/79/1719995331.jpg&#039;);}#i09fje{padding:0px 10px 0px 10px;font-size:25px;color:#ffa234;}#izbiwq{padding:0px 10px 0px 10px;font-size:18px;color:black;}#iwk9ej{white-space-collapse:preserve;}#inltum{white-space-collapse:preserve;}#i9rcrg{white-space-collapse:preserve;}#iavpv4{white-space-collapse:preserve;}#iig8kh{white-space-collapse:preserve;}#ioldgg{white-space-collapse:preserve;}#icysfh{white-space-collapse:preserve;}@media (max-width: 480px){#io9c{margin:130px 0px 0px 0px;}}', '&lt;div id=&quot;ilap&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ihgh&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ivpg&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iqe2&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i6je&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i4iy&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i2r3&quot; class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ipsxeq&quot;&gt;[navbar id=72 ]\n              &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;io9c&quot; class=&quot;about-banner-wrap banner-space about-us-bg&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-8 m-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-content text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 id=&quot;irkz&quot; class=&quot;mb-15 text-white&quot;&gt;Thailand Group Tour Packages\n                        &lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i09fje&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i5whf&quot;&gt;Thailand Group Tour Packages\n                &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;izbiwq&quot;&gt;Planning a tour package to Thailand requires taking into account several factors such as the length of your trip, the places you intend to visit, your budget, and your accommodation and activity preferences. To give you an idea, a typical Thailand tour package may include the following:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Destinations:&lt;br/&gt;Bangkok:&lt;/b&gt; The vibrant capital city is renowned for its lively street culture, temples, and modern attractions.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Chiang Mai:&lt;/b&gt; Northern Thailand is home to many historic temples, night markets and beautiful mountains that surround the area..&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phuket:&lt;/b&gt; Are you ready to experience the ultimate island getaway? Look no further than this popular destination, where stunning beaches, thrilling water activities, and a buzzing nightlife scene await you. Get ready to soak up the sun, make a splash, and dance the night away in paradise!&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Krabi:&lt;/b&gt; If you’re an adventurer seeking a paradise, look no further than this place! With its breathtaking limestone cliffs, crystal-clear waters, and easy access to stunning islands like Railay Beach, you’re bound to be swept off your feet. Get ready to experience a slice of heaven on earth!&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ayutthaya:&lt;/b&gt; This is a place of great historical importance, featuring ancient ruins that have been recognized as a UNESCO World Heritage Site.&lt;br/&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Activities:&lt;br/&gt;City Tours:&lt;/b&gt; Discover the cultural and historical sites of Bangkok.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Temple Visits:&lt;/b&gt; Explore famous temples such as Wat Arun and Wat Pho..&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Floating Markets: &lt;/b&gt;Get a taste of the traditional Thai market culture while you enjoy the scenic beauty of markets on water.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Elephant Sanctuaries:&lt;/b&gt; f you want to interact with elephants in a way that is ethical and responsible, consider visiting an elephant sanctuary. These sanctuaries provide a safe and humane environment for elephants to live in, and offer visitors the opportunity to observe and interact with these magnificent animals in a way that doesn’t harm them.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Island Hopping: &lt;/b&gt;If you want to experience the stunning tropical scenery of southern Thailand, why not explore its beautiful islands and beaches?&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cultural Shows:&lt;/b&gt; Experience the vibrant cultural scene by attending traditional dance performances or cabaret shows.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Adventure Activities:&lt;/b&gt; You can participate in thrilling activities such as snorkeling, scuba diving, or zip-lining.&lt;br/&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Accommodations:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;There is a wide range of options available to you, ranging from budget hostels to luxury resorts. Your choice can depend on your preferences and budget.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Transportation:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The travel package may include flights or ground transportation between cities, as well as optional private transfers. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meals:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Meal options vary depending on the package selected.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Guided Tours:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The package might consist of guided tours, especially for cultural and historical sites. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Free Time:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Make sure that the package includes some leisure time for personal exploration or relaxation. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Flexibility:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Some packages offer more structure, while others allow for more freedom.&lt;br/&gt;When you plan to go on a tour, it’s crucial to check the reviews, understand the details of what is included in the package, and communicate your preferences to the tour operator. You should also consider the best time to visit Thailand based on the weather conditions and any festivals or events you wish to attend. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Tour packages can be booked through travel agencies, online platforms, or specialized tour operators. Make sure you choose a reputable provider to ensure a smooth and enjoyable travel experience.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Thailand Group Tour Packages: The best place to go if 