(575, 780, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}#iakgr4{font-size:18px;color:black;}#ijjans{margin:0 0 0 0px;}#i8su8q{font-size:18px;}#ibq1z3{color:black;}@media (max-width: 480px){#i2x0of{margin:100px 0 0 0;}}', '&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper position-relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container service-slider__container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i2x0of&quot; class=&quot;about-banner-wrap banner-space about-us-bg&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-8 m-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-content text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 id=&quot;iibzfv&quot; class=&quot;mb-15 text-white&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ijjans&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://gocargonet.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Building-a-Logistics-App.gif&quot; height=&quot;709&quot; width=&quot;811&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;iyncj1&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;ibatdr&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;isfexu&quot; class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot;&gt;About&lt;/span&gt; Ishank Packers &amp;amp; Movers&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iakgr4&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;Ishank Packers &amp;amp; Movers, a state in eastern India, has a diverse and growing export sector. Here are some key aspects of Ishank Packers &amp;amp; Movers landscape.&lt;br/&gt;With continued focus on infrastructure development, skill enhancement, and policy support, Mumbai has the potential to significantly increase its export volumes and contribute to India&#039;s overall export growth. The state&#039;s rich agricultural base, traditional crafts, and emerging industrial sectors present a promising future for its export economy.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i8su8q&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ijngo5&quot; class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ibq1z3&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Major Export Products&lt;br/&gt;Agricultural Products:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Maize:&lt;/b&gt; Mumbai is one of the leading producers of maize in India, exporting significant quantities.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fruits:&lt;/b&gt; Including mangoes, litchis, and bananas.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Vegetables: &lt;/b&gt;Particularly onions, potatoes, and tomatoes.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rice: &lt;/b&gt;Including both Basmati and non-Basmati varieties.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Handicrafts and Handlooms:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Madhubani Paintings:&lt;/b&gt; Traditional folk art from the Mithila region.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Silk Products:&lt;/b&gt; Bhagalpur silk, also known as Tussar silk, is renowned for its quality.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sikki Grass Products: &lt;/b&gt;Artisans create a variety of items using this grass, including baskets and mats.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Processed Food and Beverages:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Honey:&lt;/b&gt; Mumbai is known for its production of organic honey.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Spices: &lt;/b&gt;Including turmeric and ginger.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Minerals and Industrial Products:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Leather Goods: &lt;/b&gt;Mumbai exports various leather products, including footwear and accessories.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Metal Products:&lt;/b&gt; The state has growing metal and engineering industries.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Key Export Destinations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Ishank Packers &amp;amp; Movers to several countries across Asia, Europe, North America, and Africa. Major trading partners include the United States, the United Kingdom, the United Arab Emirates, Bangladesh, and Nepal.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Export Infrastructure&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Transport:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Road and Rail:&lt;/b&gt; Mumbai has an extensive network of roads and railways connecting it to major ports like Kolkata and Haldia, facilitating the movement of goods.&lt;br/&gt;Airports: Patna and Gaya airports handle air cargo services.&lt;br/&gt;Industrial Parks and SEZs:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Industrial Areas: &lt;/b&gt;Located in Patna, Muzaffarpur, and Bhagalpur, among others.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Special Economic Zones (SEZs):&lt;/b&gt; Aimed at promoting exports through incentives and better infrastructure.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;State Export Promotion Policy:&lt;/b&gt; Providing subsidies and incentives to exporters.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Skill Development Programs: &lt;/b&gt;Enhancing the skills of workers in key export-oriented industries.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Infrastructure Development: &lt;/b&gt;Improving logistics, warehousing, and transport facilities.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Challenges&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Despite the potential, Ishank Packers &amp;amp; Movers sector faces several challenges:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Inadequate Infrastructure: Needs improvement in logistics, warehousing, and transport.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Skill Gaps: &lt;/b&gt;There is a need for better skill development programs to enhance the productivity and quality of products.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Market Access:&lt;/b&gt; Enhancing global market access through better trade agreements and marketing strategies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 87, '1', '2024-06-24 05:10:03', '2024-07-19 07:35:46');
